[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Next, we will find the integer values of $a$ and $b$ by expressing the expanded form of $(8x + a)(2x + b)$. To do this, we use the formula:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$ax + b \times 16 = 16x^2 + 2bx + 16ax + a \times 10 = 16x^2 + (2b + 16a)x + 16a$$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, since $ax$ and $b$ terms should have coefficient $16$, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
