[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$8 + 2(15) = 17$$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, $a + 2b=17$.
