[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Let $D$ be the determinant of the matrix whose column vectors are $\mathbf{a},$ $\mathbf{b},$ and $\mathbf{c}.$  Find the determinant of the matrix whose column vectors are $\mathbf{a} + \mathbf{b},$ $\mathbf{b} + \mathbf{c},$ and $\mathbf{c} + \mathbf{a},$ in terms of $D.$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To solve this problem, we start by considering the matrix \( \text{M} \) whose columns are given as \(\mathbf{a}, \mathbf{b}, \mathbf{c}\). The determinant of this matrix, denoted by \( D \), is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ D = \begin{vmatrix} a & b & c \\ b & c & a \\ c & a & b \end{vmatrix} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To find the determinant of the new matrix \(\mathbf{M}''\), whose columns are \(\mathbf{a} + \mathbf{b}, \mathbf{b} + \mathbf{c}, \mathbf{c} + \mathbf{a}\), we can use the properties of determinants. Specifically, we need to expand the determinant along the third row of \(\mathbf{M}''\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ D'' = \begin{vmatrix} a + \mathbf{b} & \mathbf{b} + \mathbf{c} & \mathbf{c} + \mathbf{a} \\ b & c & a \\ c & a & b \end{vmatrix} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m We can perform a row operation on the上年项的矩阵中左上三角部分，由于 \(\mathrm{a}\) 列和 \(\mathrm{b}\) 列均与 \(\mathrm c \) 异号的一部分进行留，所以只需计算其上三角部分即可：
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ D'' = \begin{vmatrix} a + \mathbf{b} & \mathbf{b} + \mathbf{c} & \mathbf{c} + \mathbf{a} \\ b & c & a \\ c & a & b \end{vmatrix} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m We use the property of the determinant of sum: \(\mathrm{m}\mathrm{c}_{1+\mathrm{c}_{2}} + \mathrm{m}\mathrm{c}_{1+\mathrm{c}_{3}} + \mathrm{m}\mathrm{c}_{1+\mathrm{c}_{\mathrm{e}}} = \mathrm{m}\mathrm{c}_{\mathrm{d}} \)(如果整个矩阵不可置) 现在，我们把上面的纵向矩阵 当作考虑项为加上 b 的整体，由于 b 此项减去 c 的对称，并且前面，所以可以剪刀二叉搜我们肯定是加上 c 的余项：因此我们只需要考虑上行矩阵：
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ D'' = \begin{vmatrix} a + \mathbf{b} & (\mathbf{b} + \mathbf{c} -\mathbf{c}) + \mathbf{c} \\ b & c & a \\ c & a & b \end{vmatrix} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 所以把 \(\mathbf{b} + \mathbf{c} - \mathbf{c} = \mathbf{b} \) 连接去掉，这是一个可交换式，所以我们用依然是仍然可以a扩大，得到：
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ D'' = \begin{vmatrix} a + \mathbf{b} & \mathbf{b} \\ b & a \\ c & b+c \end{vmatrix} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 展开可交换式，也是JamieLsystem
