[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To compute \(\sqrt[4]{12960000}\), we need to express the number in the fourth root as a product of its prime factors. Let's start with the given number:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ 12960000 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m We can factorize 12960000 into its prime components:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ 12960000 = 1296 \times 10000 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Next, we factorize each part:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ 1296 = 6^4 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ 10000 = 10^4 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So the prime factorization of 12960000 is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ 12960000 = 6^4 \times 10^4 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, we need to use the fourth root to express this in its radical form. We take the fourth root of each factor:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ \sqrt[4]{12960000} = \sqrt[4]{6^4 \times 10^4} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Using the property of roots, \(\sqrt[4]{a^4} = |a|\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ \sqrt[4]{6^4 \times 10^4} = \sqrt[4]{6^4} \times \sqrt[4]{10^4} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Calculate each term separately:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ \sqrt[4]{6^4} = 6 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ \sqrt[4]{10^4} = 10 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ \sqrt[4]{12960000} = 6 \times 10 = 60 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So, the final answer is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ \boxed{60} \]<|endoftext|>
