[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. **Understand the relationship of parallel lines:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Since \(\overline{AB} \parallel \overline{CD}\), alternate interior angles are equal. This means that \(\angle AXF\) and \(\angle FYD\) are alternate interior angles.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. **Use the property of alternate interior angles:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
