[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The given expression $(3x-8)+(5x+7)$ can be simplified as follows:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. Distribute the 3 in the first part of the expression: $(a+b)(c+d)$ = $ac+bd$ 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. Simplify the $(3x-8)$ terms by canceling out the 3: $3(x - \frac{8}{3})$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, the expression simplifies to:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $3x + \left(3(x - 2)^2 - \left(\frac{8}{3}\right)^2 \right) = 3x + 9 \left(x^2 -4x +4 \right) - \frac{64}{9}$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Combine all the new terms:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $3x + 9x^2 - 36x + 36 - \frac{64}{9} = 3x + 9x^2 - 33x + 31.3$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Hence the simplified expression is $3x + 9x^2 - 33x + 31.3$
