[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m ```
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The output shows that the P-value is approximately \(0.0297\), which is less than the significance level \(\alpha = 0.05\). Since the P-value is less than \(\alpha\), we reject the null hypothesis.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, we can conclude that the dispenser does not meet the required pressure rating of 15 psi at the 0.05 level of significance.
