[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The factorial of a number \(n\) is the product of all positive integers less than or equal to \(n\). So, \(4! = 4 \times 3 \times 2 \times 1 = 24\).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Let's confirm this with Python code.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m ```python
