[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Since we're looking for the product of the two numbers, we consider both possible values of y. 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m y = √72 ≈ 8.485
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m y = -√72 ≈ -8.485
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now that we have the two numbers x and y, we can find their product:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m x * y = 9 * √72
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m x * y ≈ 9 * 8.485 ≈ 76.965
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Thus, the product of the two numbers is approximately 76.965.
