[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \mathbf{B} = \mathbf{A} \cdot \frac{1}{2} = \frac{1}{2} \begin{pmatrix} 4 & 6 \\ -2 & 10 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} \frac{2}{2} & \frac{3}{2} \\ -1 & 5 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 1 & \frac{3}{2} \\ -1 & 5 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Next, we need to find $\mathbf{B}^{-1}$. To do this, we use the formula for the inverse of a 2x2 matrix:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \mathbf{B}^{-1} = \frac{1}{\text{det}(\mathbf{B})} \begin{pmatrix} \text{adj}(\mathbf{B}) & -\text{adj}(\mathbf{B})^T \\ \text{adj}(\mathbf{B})^T & \text{adj}(\mathbf{B}) \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m where $\text{adj}(\mathbf{B})$ is the cofactor matrix of $\mathbf{B}$, given by:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \mathbf{adj}(\mathbf{B}) = \begin{pmatrix} \text{adj}(B_{11}) & -\text{adj}(B_{12}) \\ \text{adj}(B_{21}) & \text{adj}(B_{22}) \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} \frac{3}{2} & -5 \\ 5 & \frac{1}{2} \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Thus, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \mathbf{adj}(\mathbf{B}) = \begin{pmatrix} \frac{3}{2} & -5 \\ 5 & \frac{1}{2} \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The determinant of $\mathbf{B}$:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \text{det}(\mathbf{B}) = \left(1 \cdot \frac{1}{2}\right) - \left(\frac{3}{2} \cdot 5\right) = \frac{1}{2} - \frac{15}{2} = -7
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, the inverse of $\mathbf{B}$ is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \mathbf{B}^{-1} = \frac{1}{-7} \begin{pmatrix} \frac{3}{2} & -5 \\ 5 & \frac{1}{2} \end{pmatrix} = -\frac{1}{7} \begin{pmatrix} \frac{3}{2} & -5 \\ 5 & \frac{1}{2} \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} -\frac{3}{14} & \frac{5}{7} \\ -\frac{5}{7} & -\frac{1}{7} \end{pmatrix}
