[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m = 6918
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 7. Substitute these values back into the expression for the whole expression:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3^7 + 8^3 - 2^4 - (-2^4 + 8^3 + 3^7) = 282656 - 1160 + 6918 = 272006
