[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $\sqrt{2013^2+1997^2}-\sqrt{2014^2+1998^2}=\quad$ $=$ ?
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m (A) $$ 1$$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
