[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Evaluate
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[\begin{vmatrix} x & \sin \theta & \cos \theta \\ -\sin \theta & -x & 1 \\ \cos \theta & 1 & x \end{vmatrix}.\]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To evaluate the determinant of the given matrix, we need to calculate its elements and then find the determinant of the resulting matrix.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Given matrix:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m A = \begin{vmatrix} x & \sin \theta & \cos \theta \\ -\sin \theta & -x & 1 \\ \cos \theta & 1 & x \end{vmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m First, we calculate the determinant using the formula for a 3x3 matrix:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \text{det}(A) = x \cdot \begin{vmatrix} -x & 1 \\ 1 & x \end{vmatrix} - \sin \theta \cdot \begin{vmatrix} -\sin \theta & 1 \\ \cos \theta & x \end{vmatrix} + \cos \theta \cdot \begin{vmatrix} -\sin \theta & -x \\ \cos \theta & 1 \end{vmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, let's compute each determinant individually.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. The first minor is \(\begin{vmatrix} -x & 1 \\ 1 & x \end{vmatrix}\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \begin{vmatrix} -x & 1 \\ 1 & x \end{vmatrix} = (-x) \cdot x - 1 \cdot 1 = -x^2 - 1
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. The second minor is \(\begin{vmatrix} -\sin \theta & 1 \\ \cos \theta & x \end{vmatrix}\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \begin{vmatrix} -\sin \theta & 1 \\ \cos \theta & x \end{vmatrix} = (-\sin \theta) \cdot x - 1 \cdot \cos \theta = -x \sin \theta - \cos \theta
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. The third minor is \(\begin{vmatrix} -\sin \theta & -x \\ \cos \theta & 1 \end{vmatrix}\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \begin{vmatrix} -\sin \theta & -x \\ \cos \theta & 1 \end{vmatrix} = (-\sin \theta) \cdot 1 - (-x) \cdot \cos \theta = -\sin \theta + x \cos \theta
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Substitute these back into the determinant formula:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \text{det}(A) = x \cdot (-x^2 - 1) - \sin \theta \cdot (-x \sin \theta - \cos \theta) + \cos \theta \cdot (-\sin \theta + x \cos \theta)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \text{det}(A) = -x^3 - x - \sin \theta (x \sin \theta + \cos \theta) + \cos \theta (-\sin \theta + x \cos \theta)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Simplify further:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \text{det}(A) = -x^3 - x - \sin \theta x \sin \theta - \sin \theta \cos \theta + \cos \theta \sin \theta - \cos \theta x \cos \theta
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Combine like terms:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \text{det}(A) = -x^3 - x - L_1 - L_2 + L_3 = -x^3 - x + L_1 + L_2 - L_3
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Determine the values of $L_1$, $L_2$, and $L_3$:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m L_1 = -L_2 = \sin \theta \cos \theta
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m L_3 = -L_1 + L_2 + x \sin \theta - \cos \theta \cos \theta
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The determinant is then:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \text{det}(A) = -x^3 - x - L_2 + L_1 + L_3 = -x^3 - x - \sin \theta \cos \theta + \sin \theta \cos \theta + L_1 + L_2 + x \sin \theta - \cos \theta \cos \theta
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \text{det}(A) = -x^3 + x + L_1 + L_2 + x \sin \theta
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Finally, let's simplify further and combine terms:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \boxed{-x^3 + x + \sin \theta}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
