[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Thus, the correct sum of odd and even position digits does not satisfy all conditions exactly. Instead, let's re-evaluate for simpler values:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - For \( k = 0 \):
