[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ \text{Area} = \frac{1}{4} \sqrt{5(5+2\sqrt{5})} a^2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m where \( a \) is the length of one side of the pentagon. Since the equation involves irrational numbers, you can indeed use mathematical software or AI to calculate it. Here's the Python code using SymPy to find and return the area:
