[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Since $x$ and $z$ can be zero because they're nonzero, we must have $k = 0$. Thus, we can further simplify.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
