[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. $3x - 2z = 0 \quad \Rightarrow \quad 3x = 2z \quad \Rightarrow \quad x = \frac{2z}{3}$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
