[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. $6z = -3z$ (which isn't possible since neither can be zero)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. $6z = 2z$ (which simplifies and gives $z = 0$)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
