[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m From the given magnitudes, we can determine that $|a| = |b|$, meaning the magnitudes of $a$ and $b$ are equal:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m |a| = |b| = 2 \text{ or } \sqrt{26}
