[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Given that we want the positive t value, using the following formula and substitution:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m |t-2i| = \sqrt{t^2 + 4}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The problem is then to find t, which equates to finding the positive root of $t^2 + 4 = |t-2i|$. 
