[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Given $|a| = 2$, we can evaluate $|t-2i|$:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m |t-2i| = \sqrt{t^2 + 4}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$
