[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Given $\overrightarrow{a_{1}}=2\mathrm{i}-k\mathrm{j},{\overrightarrow{a_{2}}}=4+\overrightarrow{b}$ and $\overrightarrow{c}=\overrightarrow{a_{1}}-\overrightarrow{a_{2}}$. 
