[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - Number of lengths: \(7\)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \text{Total combinations for } n = 5 : 7 \times 90 = 630
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m ### Step 4: Sum up all combinations
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Sum of possible combinations:
