[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m At the given point of the vector $k$-parallelism must lie, is $(0,0) \cdot (k \mathbf{a} + \frac{3}{4} \mathbf{b}) = 0$.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Since $$(k \mathbf{a} + \frac{3}{4} \mathbf{b}) \cdot (0, 0) = 0$$, 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m we have $k \mathbf{a} + \frac{3}{4} \mathbf{b}$ has no integer $z$-coordinate when $|z| < \sqrt{16}$.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Hence, the vector has zero or at most one $z$-coordinate on the line. That is,
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[0 = \left\|\frac{3}{4} \mathbf{b} - k \mathbf{a}\right\|\]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Hence,
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \|k \mathbf{a} + \frac{3}{4} \mathbf{b}\|^2 &= \|k \mathbf{a} + \frac{3}{4} \mathbf{b} - \mathbf{0}\|^2 \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \Rightarrow \|\mathbf{a} - \frac{3}{4} \mathbf{b}\|^2 &= \frac{9}{16} \|\mathbf{a}\|^2
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m which results in $k = \pm \frac{3}{2}$. Since $k$ is positive,
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[k = \boxed{\frac{3}{2}}\]
