[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $(-3 + 5 + 9 + 13 + 17 - 19 - 21 - 23)$ + $(-7 + 11 + 15 + 19 - 21 - 23 - 25 - 27)$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now let's simplify each group separately:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 6 - 9 - 12 - 15 + 19 - 21 - 23 + 25 + 29 - ...
