[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m -6 - 9 - 12 - 15 + 19 - 21 - 23 + 25 + 29
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m = -60 + 40
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m = -20
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The expression when split into pairs gives us:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $(-3 + 5 + 9 + 13 + 17)$ + $(-7 + 11 + 15 + 19 - 21 - 23 - 25 - 27)$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Grouping terms in pairs again, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $(-3 + 5 + 9 + 13 + 17 + 19 - 21 - 23 - 25 - 27) + (-7 + 11 + 15 - 19 - 21 - 23 - 25 - 27)$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Simplifying inside the parentheses:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $(-3) + 5 + 9 + 13 + 17 + 19 - 21 - 23 - 25 - 27 + (-7) + 11 + 15 - 19 - 21 - 23 - 25 - 27$
