[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Let $\mathbf{M} = \begin{pmatrix} 0 & -5 \\ -2 & 4 \end{pmatrix}.$  There exist scalars $p$ and $q$ such that
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[\mathbf{M}^2 = p \mathbf{M} + q \mathbf{I}.\]Enter the ordered pair $(p,q).$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Let's start by finding the matrix $\mathbf{M}^2$ and then solve for $p$ and $q$ using the given equation $\mathbf{M}^2 = p \mathbf{M} + q \mathbf{I}.$ Let's calculate $\mathbf{M}^2$ first:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \mathbf{M}^2 = \mathbf{M} \cdot \mathbf{M} = \begin{pmatrix} 0 & -5 \\ -2 & 4 \end{pmatrix} \cdot \begin{pmatrix} 0 & -5 \\ -2 & 4 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 0 \cdot 0 + (-5) \cdot (-2) & 0 \cdot (-5) + (-5) \cdot 4 \\ -2 \cdot 0 + 4 \cdot (-2) & -2 \cdot (-5) + 4 \cdot 4 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 10 & -20 \\ -8 & 20 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \mathbf{M}^2 = \mathbf{p} \mathbf{M} + \mathbf{q} \mathbf{I} = \begin{pmatrix} p & -20 \\ -8 & 20 \end{pmatrix} = p \begin{pmatrix} 0 & -5 \\ -2 & 4 \end{pmatrix} + \begin{pmatrix} 0 & -5 \\ -2 & 4 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} p \cdot 0 + (-2) \cdot (-5) & p \cdot (-5) + (-2) \cdot 4 \\ -2 \cdot 0 + 4 \cdot (-2) & -2 \cdot (-5) + 4 \cdot 4 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 10 & -20 \\ -8 & 20 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m This confirms that $\mathbf{M}^2 = p \mathbf{M} + q \mathbf{I}.$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m From this, we can see that:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m p = 10
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m and
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m -q = -20 \implies q = 20
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, the ordered pair $(p, q)$ is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \boxed{(10, 20)}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
