[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - $x + 2 = -1 + 2 = 1$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - $2x + 2 = 2(-1) + 2 = -2 + 2 = 0$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - $4x + 3 = 4(-1) + 3 = -4 + 3 = -1$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - $7x + 3 = 7(-1) + 3 = -7 + 3 = -4$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Given the ratios are equal:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[ \frac{1}{0} \text{ or } \frac{-1}{-4} \quad (evaluate: valid because $1 \cdot 4 \neq 0 \cdot -4$) 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2.) For $x = -6$:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - $x+2 = -6 + 2 = -4$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - $2x+2 = 2(-6) + 2 = -12 + 2 = -10$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - $4x+3 = 4(-6) + 3 = -24 + 3 = -21$
