[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \sqrt[4]{47 - 2x} + \sqrt[4]{35 + 2x} = 4
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Since the fourth power in both terms is the same, we can take out a common fourth root from both sides to eliminate the fourth roots:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 47 - 2x = 4 \quad \text{and} \quad 35 + 2x = k^4 \quad \text{for some integer} \quad k
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
