[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, we need to verify that \(x = \frac{43}{2}\) satisfies the condition. Substitute \(x = \frac{43}{2}\) into the original equation:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
