[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Simplify inside the fourth roots:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
