[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To solve the inequality \(\left| x - 1 \right| + \left| x + 2 \right| < 5\), we need to consider different cases based on the values of \(x\) that satisfy the absolute value conditions. The critical points where the expressions inside the absolute values change sign are \(x = -2\) and \(x = 1\).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m ### Case 1: \(x < -2\)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m In this interval, both \(x - 1\) and \(x + 2\) are negative, so we have:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \left| x - 1 \right| = -(x - 1) = -x + 1
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \left| x + 2 \right| = -(x + 2) = -x - 2
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Thus, the inequality becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m -x + 1 - x - 2 < 5
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Simplifying this, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m -2x - 1 < 5
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Adding 1 to both sides:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m -2x < 6
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Dividing by -2 (and remembering to reverse the inequality sign):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m x > -3
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So, in this case, the solution is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m -3 < x < -2
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m ### Case 2: \(-2 \leq x < 1\)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m In this interval, \(x - 1\) is non-negative and \(x + 2\) is positive, so we have:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \left| x - 1 \right| = x - 1
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \left| x + 2 \right| = x + 2
