[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Thus, the inequality becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m x - 1 + x + 2 < 5
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Simplifying this, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
