[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. Calculate the maximum selling price per ticket: $\$13.50$.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. Divide the total amount of money Jane has by her selling price to find out the maximum number of tickets she can buy.
