[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    So, \(x = -1\) is not a root.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Let's test \(x = -3\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    f(-3) = (-3)^3 + (-3)^2 + 2 \cdot (-3) + 3 = -27 + 9 - 6 + 3 = -21 \neq 0
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
