[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    = (12 - 3\sqrt{7})(3) + (12 + 3\sqrt{7})(3) = 36 - 9\sqrt{7} + 36 + 9\sqrt{7} = 72
