[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    By Vieta's formulas, the sum of the roots of \(g(x)\) taken one at a time (which are the same as \(f(x)\)) is \(0\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    1 + (3 + \sqrt{7}) + (3 - \sqrt{7}) = 1 = b(1!) + c(1) + d(1)
