[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, we add the ages of the younger children:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4 + 7 + 7 = 18 years
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
