[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To find the remainder when (24^{50} - 15^{50}) is divided by 13, we can break the problem into two parts: calculating the remainder of (24^{50} mod 13) and calculating the remainder of (15^{50} mod 13).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m First, we calculate ( log_{13} (24^{50}) mod 1 ):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \log Civil_13{log_{13}24^{50}} = log Civil_{13} ((24)^{50})
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
