[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    x = 10
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4. **Translate the \(x\)-intercept into a real number on the \(x\)-axis:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
