[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To calculate the automorphic number \(b_{20}\) for the sequence \(b_1, b_2, \ldots\) defined by \(b_1 = 1\), \(b_2 = 2\), and \(b_{n+1} = b_n b_{n-1}\), we need to expand the sequence up to the 20th term.
