[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m # For s = 3, the smallest d is 10 (since 10 ≤ 3).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m # For s = 4, the smallest d is 40 (since 40 ≤ 4).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m # And so on.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m # The total sum is the sum of all d, which can be calculated as follows:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m # d = 1, a = b = 0 for all s for s = 1 to 100.
