[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \frac{7!}{3!4!} = \frac{7 \times 6 \times 5 \times 4 \times 3!}{3!4!} = \frac{7 \times 6 \times 5}{4! \times 4} = \frac{7 \times 6 \times 5 \times 3!}{(3!)^2(4)}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Step 2: Simplify the expression.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$
