[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Step 4: To express this value in LaTeX format, we must combine the terms.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Step 5: Write the final answer.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \boxed{5} = 2 \left(3\binom{7}{6}\right) = 2 \left(3 \times \frac{7!(7-3)!}{3!4!4!}\right) = 2 \left(3 \times \frac{7 \times 6 \times 5}{(3!)^2 \times 4^2}\right) = 3 \times \frac{7 \times 6 \times 5}{6 \times 4 \times 4} = 720
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
