[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    We want to find the digit at position $4037$. To do this, we can find the place by making a multiple of 6, which gives us the number of digits in the repeating sequence:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
