[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    The remainder of this division is the new number of digits to count:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    4037 \mod 10^5 = 7
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    So, there are 7 digits in the repeating sequence, and counting them from 0 happens after this sequence, yielding a total count:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
