[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Therefore, counting 8 digits from 0.5 results in 0.5 after 8 digits. Thus, 4037 belongs in the 8th place of the repeating sequence:
