[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m A farmer has a rectangular field with dimensions $2m+7$ and $m-2$. If the field has an area of 51 square units, what is the value of $m$?
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
