[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To solve for the value of \( m \), we can set up an equation based on the dimensions of the field and the given area. The field has dimensions \( 2m + 7 \) meters by \( m - 2 \) meters, and it has an area of 51 square units. The area of a rectangle is given by the product of its length and width. Therefore, we can write the equation:
