[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m First, let's expand the left-hand side of the equation:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ (2m + 7)(m - 2) = 2m \cdot m + 2m \cdot (-2) + 7 \cdot m + 7 \cdot (-2) \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ = 2m^2 - 4m + 7m - 14 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ = 2m^2 + 3m - 14 \]
