[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So, the equation becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ 2m^2 + 3m - 14 = 51 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Next, we move all terms to one side of the equation to set it to zero:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
