[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Given $a_2 = a_1 + a_2$, we observe that $a_3 = a_1 + a_2 = 2$.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - It appears that $a_{n+1} = a_n + a_{n+1}$ gives us a quadratic sequence. Solving this, we get $a_{n+1} = a_n + 1$.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. **Geometric Series:**
