[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m First, let's simplify it step-by-step:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m ### Step 1: Simplify \((2 + 1)(2 + 1^2)\)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - \(2 + 1\) comes from \(2 + 1\)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - \(1^2\) is 1
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - \(2 + 1^2\) gives \(3\)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So, \(2 + 1 \left(2 + 1^2\right)\) simplifies to \(3\).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m ### Step 2: Simplify \((2^4 + 1^4 \right)\)
