[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So, \(2^4 + 1^4 \rightarrow 17 \).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Putting it together:
