[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \frac{41}{x} = 85
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, solve for \( x \):
