[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, let's find the sum of the series:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$1 + 5\left(\frac{1 - \sqrt{n^2 - 1} + \sqrt{n^2 - 2}}{2}\right) + 9\left(\frac{1 - \sqrt{n^2 - 1} + \sqrt{n^2 - 2}}{2}\right)^2 + 13\left(\frac{1 - \sqrt{n^2 - 1} + \sqrt{n^2 - 2}}{2}\right)^3 + \dotsb$$
