[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Thus, \( \frac{\sqrt{1}}{2} = 1 \),
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
