[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m If
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[\frac{x}{a} + \frac{y}{b} + \frac{z}{c} = 3 \quad \text{and} \quad \frac{a}{x} + \frac{b}{y} + \frac{c}{z} = 0,\]find $\frac{x^2}{a^2} + \frac{y^2}{b^2} + \frac{z^2}{c^2}.$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \frac{x}{a} + \frac{y}{b} + \frac{z}{c} &= 3 \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \frac{a}{x} + \frac{b}{y} + \frac{c}{z} &= 0
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Recognize that $\frac{1}{x} + \frac{1}{y} + \frac{1}{z} = xyz \cdot \frac{1}{abc},$ so
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m                 $$x + y + z = ab + bc + ca.$$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Also,
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m                 $$\frac{x^2}{a^2} + \frac{y^2}{b^2} + \frac{z^2}{c^2} = 1 + \left(-\frac{ xyz}{a^2b^2c^2}\right).\tag{\square}$$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m And we have $xyz = -(a + b + c)(ab + bc + ca) = (-a - b - c)(ab + bc + ca).$ Since
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m                 $$\begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m       ab + bc + ca &= \left(\frac{a+b+c}{3}\right)x\\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m       (-a - b - c)(ab + bc + ca) &= (-a - b - c)(\frac{1}{3}x^2) = -(a+b+c)\frac{x}{3} \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   \end{align*},$$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m we can use equation \square for $x\mapsto \frac{x}{3}.$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Since $x$ lies in the closed interval $[0, \frac{1}{3})$, then neither $x, \frac{1}{x}$ are in $\{0, \frac{1}{3)}$.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So,
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$\begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - \frac{ xyz}{a^2b^2c^2} = - \frac{(a + b + c)\frac{x}{3}}{a^2b^2c^2}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m     &=\underbrace{\frac{-a - b - c}{a^2b^2}},\\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \frac{x^2}{a^2} + \frac{y^2}{b^2} + \frac{z^2}{c^2} &= 1 + \left(\underbrace{-\frac{a+b+c}{3}}_{ab+bc+ca}\right).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \end{align*}$$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $\boxed{\frac{x^2}{a^2} + \frac{y^2}{b^2} + \frac{z^2}{c^2} = 3+\frac{(-a - b - c)}{3}.}$<|endoftext|>
