[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - \( -9 \) is positive.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Step 4: Calculate the positive difference.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
