[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 7. For \( n = 7 \):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    n+1 = 7 + 1 = 8 \quad \Rightarrow \quad \text{the prime number is } 8
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
