[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ = 1 \cdot 1331 + 3 \cdot 121 + 9 \cdot 11 + 2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ = 1331 + 363 + 99 + 2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ = 1705_{10} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, we subtract the base 10 equivalent of $1392_{11}$ from $2911_{11}$:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
