[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Finally, we convert $2068_{10}$ back to base 11:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m We divide 2068 by 11 to find the quotient and the remainder:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
