[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So, $2068_{10} = 183 \cdot 11^2 + 3 \cdot 11^1 + 3 \cdot 11^0$. To convert this to base 11:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
