[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m In a three-dimensional coordinate system with origin $O,$ points $A,$ $B,$ and $C$ are on the $x$-, $y$-, and $z$-axes, respectively.   If the areas of triangles $OAB,$ $OAC,$ and $OBC$ are 4, 6, and 12, respectively, compute the area of triangle $ABC.$
