[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 非常好的问题！我们该怎么做呢？
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 首先，需要明确 $CX$ 是 $\triangle ABC$ 的高。因为这是一个相似三角形，所以 $\angle CXA = \angle CBA = 45^\circ$, $\angle CXB = \angle ABC = 90^\circ$. 由余弦定理可得，$\cos(\angle ACB) = \frac{AB}{CA} \sin(\angle ACB) = \frac{AB}{CA} \cdot \frac{AC}{BC} \sin(\angle AXB) = \frac{AB}{CA} \cdot \frac{AC}{BC} \cdot \sin(\angle CAX) = \frac{AB}{CA}$. 因此，$\angle ACB = \angle CAX = 30^\circ$。所以我们有：
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$\cos(45^\circ) = \frac{AB}{CA}$$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$\frac{\sqrt{2}}{2} = \frac{AB}{CA}$$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 根据勾股定理，$CA \approx 4\sqrt{2}$。所以：
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$AB \approx 4$$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 接下来，我们求出 $AX$ 就很简单了。因为 $CX \cdot \angle AXB = AB \cdot BC$, 故有：$$\frac{AX}{\theta} = \frac{AB}{BC} \cdot \sin(\angle ACB)$$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$\frac{AX}{30^\circ} = \frac{4}{CA} \cdot \frac{1}{\sin(45^\circ)}$$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$AX = 4 \cdot \frac{\sqrt{3}}{300} \cdot 30 = \frac{4\sqrt{3}}{5}$$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 因此，$AX$ 等于 $\frac{4\sqrt{3}}{5}$。答案是 $\boxed{\frac{4\sqrt{3}}{5}}$。
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 	endif
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 	endif<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
