[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - \(d = \frac{2}{5} - 1 = -\frac{3}{5} \neq \frac{2}{5}\)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Option G cannot be direction vector.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 7. \(\begin{pmatrix} 40 \\ 16 \end{pmatrix}\)
