[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Change in \(y\) = \(16 - 0 = 16\)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Check if \(40 - 16 = 24 \neq \frac{2}{5}\)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Option H cannot be direction vector.
