[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \begin{vmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 0 & 1 & 1 \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 0 & 1 & 1 \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m b & 1 & 1
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \end{vmatrix}.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The first matrix has:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
