[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m A suitcase lock has 4 dials with the digits $0, 1, 2,..., 9$ on each. How many different settings are possible if all four digits have to be different?
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
