[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m D: $\lim\limits_{n\rightarrow \infty } \sqrt{{a}_{n}}=\frac{5}{4}\sqrt{{b}_{n}}, \sqrt{{a}_{n}}$ is a convergent sequence.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To solve this problem, we need to use the given information about the sequences \(\{a_n\}\) and \(\{b_n\}\). Specifically, we know that:
