[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \lim_{n \rightarrow \infty} \frac{a_n}{b_n} = \lim_{n \rightarrow \infty} \frac{a_n b_n}{a_n b_n} = \lim_{n \rightarrow \infty} 1 = 1
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Since \(1 \neq \frac{5}{4}\), Statement B is false.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m ### Step 3: Analyze Statement C
