[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4. **Rearrange the equation to set it to zero**:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    0 = 31.7x^2 - 10x + 31.7
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 5. **Solve the quadratic equation**:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    We can use the quadratic formula \(x = \frac{-b \pm \sqrt{b^2 - 4ac}}{2a}\), where \(a = 31.7\), \(b = -10\), and \(c = 31.7\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
