[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Day 4: 32 stamps
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Day 5: 40 stamps
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, we can calculate the total number of stamps collected over the 5 days by summing these values:
