[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 120 / 5 = 24
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, the average number of stamps collected per day is 24.<|endoftext|>
