[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. Convert 200 to base 2:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - 200 divided by 2 gives a quotient of 100 and a remainder of 0. So, \( 200 = 2^{10} + 0 \).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - The leftmost digit is 1, and it has 1 digit.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. Convert 1200 to base 2:
