[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - 18 divided by 2 gives a quotient of 9 and a remainder of 0. So, \( 18 = 2^{3}^{1} + 0^{1} \).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - 9 divided by 2 gives a quotient of 4 and a remainder of 1. So, \( 9 = 2^{3}^{1} + 1^{1} \).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - 4 divided by 2 gives a quotient of 2 and a remainder of 0. So, \( 4 = 2^{2}^{1} + 0^{1} \).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - 2 divided by 2 gives a quotient of 1 and a remainder of 0. So, \( 2 = 2^{1}^{1} + 0^{1} \).
