[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m We will work on simplifying the given expression step by step.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. First, distribute the constants inside the parentheses:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3(x^2 - x^3) + 2(x - 2x^2 + 3x^5) - (4x^3 - x^2)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. Distribute the constants to each term inside the parentheses, while also multiplying by the constants outside the parentheses in the fractions and coefficients:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3x^2 - 3x^3 + 2x - 2x^2 + 6x^5 - 4x^3 + x^2
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. Now, we need to group the like terms (terms with the same variable):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4. Like terms containing $x^2$:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2x - 4x^3 + x^2
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 5. Like terms containing $x^3$:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m -3x^3
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 6. Like terms containing $x^5$ (which is not present in this expression):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 6x^5
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 7. Like terms:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m -3x^3 + x^2
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$ (note that $x^3$ becomes $-x^3$ after adding and subtracting $2x$)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 8. Rewrite the original expression in a more organized form:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3x^2 - 3x^3 + 2x - 2x^2 + 6x^5 - 4x^3 + x^2
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 9. Combine like terms:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$
