[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, we combine all the terms:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3x^2 + 6x^5 - 7x^3 + 4x^2 + 3x
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 10. Extract the coefficient of $x^2$ from the combined terms:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$
