[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Steve has a total of 1.25 dollar in change ($1.00 plus $0.25). We need to come up with the number of ways Steve can pay for exactly $1.00 and/or exactly $0.25 on each item he wants to get paid for.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
