[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m  Kylie can rake 25 square feet in one 2-hour rain.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m If the atmosphere adds another 10%, the area Kylie can rake in one 2-hour rain is 10% more.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 10% = 0.10
