[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 5^1 = 5
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 5^0 = 1
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Substituting these values into the equation:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2 \cdot 25 + 4 \cdot 5 + 2 \cdot 1
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m = 50 + 20 + 2
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m = 72
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So, $242_{5} = 72_{10}$.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. **Convert $367_{8}$ to base 10:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
