[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m We can then find the values:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. \(a_7 = 120 = a_6 + a_5 = a_5 + 120 - a_5 = 120\)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Given \(a_7 = 120\), and solving it iteratively, it shows:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[a_2 + a_1 = 60\] since \(a_3 + a_2 = 60\)
