[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Thus, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[a_4 = a_3 + a_2 = 60\] which tells us we know:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[a_4 = a_2 + a_1 = 60\]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Hence, we find:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[a_1 = 0\]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[a_2 = 60\]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[a_3 = 90\]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[a_4 = 60\]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[a_5 = 120\]
