[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m A dealer sold 200 cars, and the data for some of those sales are recorded in this table. If the rest of the cars she sold were Hondas, how many Hondas did she sell?
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \begin{tabular}{ |c | c|}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \hline \textbf{Type of Car} & \textbf{$\%$ of Total Cars Sold} \\ \hline
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Audi & $15\%$ \\ \hline
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Toyota & $22\%$ \\ \hline
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Acura & $28\%$ \\ \hline
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \end{tabular}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Certainly. Let's break it down:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The table gives us the following data for the total sales:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. Audi: 15%
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. Toyota: 22%
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. Acura: 28%
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m We want to find out how many Hondas (which are the remaining cars after considering Audi, Toyota, and Acura) sold. This can be calculated by subtracting the percentages of Audi, Toyota, and Acura from 100%.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Steps:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. Subtract the percentage of Audi from 100%:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    100\% - 15\% = 85\%
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. Subtract the percentage of Toyota from the remaining percentage after Audi:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    85\% - 22\% = 63\%
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. Subtract the percentage of Acura from the remaining percentage after the first two categories:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    63\% - 28\% = 35\%
