[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 6. **Sequence Street Challenge**:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Knowing \( f(-x) \) must always equal \( f(x) \) as derived from:
