[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 7. Since \(c = 3 - a + b\), we can substitute \(c\) into the equation to find \(a - b\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    a - b = 3 + (3 - a + b)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
