[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Quadrilateral $CDEF$ is a parallelogram. Its area is $36$ square units. Points $G$ and $H$ are the midpoints of sides $CD$ and $EF,$ respectively. What is the area of triangle $CDJ?$ [asy]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m draw((0,0)--(30,0)--(12,8)--(22,8)--(0,0));
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m draw((10,0)--(12,8));
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m draw((20,0)--(22,8));
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m label("$I$",(0,0),W);
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m label("$C$",(10,0),S);
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m label("$F$",(20,0),S);
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m label("$J$",(30,0),E);
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m label("$D$",(12,8),N);
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m label("$E$",(22,8),N);
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m label("$G$",(11,5),W);
