[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m This can be factored as:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[(a - 2)(a + 2) = 0\]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Setting each factor equal to zero gives us two solutions:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[a - 2 = 0 \quad \text{or} \quad a + 2 = 0\]
