[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4.5x = 1 + \text{(constant)} \quad \text{(since } \frac{1}{2} = 0.5\text{)}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m This simplifies to:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \frac{1}{2}x + \frac{1}{2}y + z = 0.5 + \text{(constant)}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Next, we need to ensure \(\gcd(|A|,|B|,|C|,|D|) = 1\). A simple choice is to set \(\text{(constant)} = 0.5\).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
