[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Completely factor the expression: $$x^8-256$$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m We first recognize this as a difference of squares:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$x^8-256 = (x^4)^2 - 16^2 .$$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, we factor it using the difference of squares formula \( a^2 - b^2 = (a+b)(a-b) \):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m x^8-256 &= (x^4+16)(x^4-16).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Next, we can factor further using \( x^4-16 = (x^2)^2 - 4^2 \):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m x^8-256 &= (x^4+16)(x^2-4)(x^2+4).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Since \( x^2 - 4 \) is a difference of squares and \( 4 \) is a perfect square, we can rearrange it as:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m (x^2)^2 - (2)^2 &= (x^2-2)(x^2+2).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Similarly, \( x^2 + 4 \) is also a difference of squares:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m x^8-256 &= (x^2+2)(x^2-2)(x^2+4).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Putting everything together:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$x^8-256 = (x^4+16)(x^2-4)(x^2+4)(x^2+2)(x^2-2)$$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, fully factoring the expression is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$-8(x^4+16) \cdot (x^2-4) \cdot (x^2+4) \cdot (x^2+2) \cdot (x^2-2)$$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
