[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To find \(\det(\mathbf{A}^2 - 2 \mathbf{A})\), we will proceed step by step.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m First, let's compute \(\mathbf{A}^2\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \mathbf{A}^2 = \mathbf{A} \cdot \mathbf{A}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Given \(\mathbf{A} = \begin{pmatrix} 1 & 3 \\ 2 & 1 \end{pmatrix}\), we have:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \mathbf{A}^2 = \begin{pmatrix} 1 & 3 \\ 2 & 1 \end{pmatrix} \cdot \begin{pmatrix} 1 & 3 \\ 2 & 1 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Perform the matrix multiplication:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \mathbf{A}^2 = \begin{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m (1 \cdot 1) + (3 \cdot 2) & (1 \cdot 3) + (3 \cdot 1) \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m (2 \cdot 1) + (1 \cdot 2) & (2 \cdot 3) + (1 \cdot 1)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m = \begin{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1 + 6 & 3 + 3 \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2 + 2 & 6 + 1
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m = \begin{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 7 & 6 \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4 & 7
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Next, we find \(2 \mathbf{A}\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2 \mathbf{A} = 2 \begin{pmatrix} 1 & 3 \\ 2 & 1 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 2 & 6 \\ 4 & 2 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, compute the \(\mathbf{A}^2 - 2 \mathbf{A}\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \mathbf{A}^2 - 2 \mathbf{A} = \begin{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 7 & 6 \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4 & 7
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \end{pmatrix} - \begin{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2 & 6 \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4 & 2
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m = \begin{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 7 - 2 & 6 - 6 \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4 - 4 & 7 - 2
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m = \begin{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 5 & 0 \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 0 & 5
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Finally, we need the determinant of this matrix:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \det(\mathbf{A}^2 - 2 \mathbf{A}) = \det \begin{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 5 & 0 \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 0 & 5
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The determinant of a 2x2 matrix \(\begin{pmatrix} a & b \\ c & d \end{pmatrix}\) is \(ad - bc\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \det \begin{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 5 & 0 \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 0 & 5
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \end{pmatrix} = (5 \cdot 5) - (0 \cdot 0) = 25 - 0 = 25
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Thus, the final answer is:
