[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m We need to find integers \( A_i \) that sum up to 19. Let's start by calculating the sum of the given values:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
