[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Given $235_7+1324_5^10^11$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To solve the problem, we must first convert both numbers to base 10, then perform the addition in base 10.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. Convert $235_7$ to base 10:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   235_7 = 2 \cdot 7^2 + 3 \cdot 7^1 + 5 \cdot 7^0 = 2 \cdot 49 + 3 \cdot 7 + 5 \cdot 1 = 98 + 21 + 5 = 124
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. Convert $1324_5$ to base 10:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   1324_5 = 1 \cdot 5^3 + 3 \cdot 5^2 + 2 \cdot 5^1 + 4 \cdot 5^0 = 1 \cdot 125 + 3 \cdot 25 + 2 \cdot 5 + 4 \cdot 1 = 125 + 75 + 10 + 4 = 214
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   Note: Since subtraction in base 10 has a particular property like decimal subtraction, we always subtract from 256:  
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   214_{10} = (256 - 124)_7
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m     
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. Find the sum in base 10:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   Combine the base 10 equivalents and add according to the place values:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   124 + (256 - 124) = 124 + 132 = 256
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4. Now add this sum in base 10 reaction:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   Answer: 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   235_7 + 1324_5 = 256_{10}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   $$
