[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m      a \approx 105.68^\circ
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 8. **Verify the correct coordinates:**
