[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. Simplify the third term: \(4 \cdot 187\).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    4 \cdot 187 = 748
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Now, reduce modulo $17$: \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    748 \mod 17
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Next, we perform the calculations modulo $17$:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. Calculate \(459 \mod 17\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
