[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. **Evaluate the innermost operation: \(-345^4\)**:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    -345^4 = -345 \times -345 \times -345 \times -345 = -83,207,062,350
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. **Raise the result to the second power: \((1)^2\)**:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    (1^2) = 1^2 = 1
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. **Raise 1 to the fourth power: \(1^4\)**:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    (1^4) = 1^4 = 1
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4. **Take the square root of 1 (to get \(\sqrt{1}\))**: 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \sqrt{1} = 1
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 5. **Raise this result to the negative power \((-2)\)**:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    (1)^{-2} = 1^{-2} = \frac{1}{1} = 1
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
