[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Thus, the number of unit cubes with at least two painted faces is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ 216 - 1296 + 1296 = 0 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m ### Conclusion
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The fraction of the unit cubes that have at least two painted faces is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ \frac{0}{216} = 0 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, the fraction is:
