[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, the point of intersection of the asymptotes is \(\boxed{(0,0)}\).<|endoftext|>
