[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 7. **Find the critical points by using the quadratic formula:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    The quadratic formula is given by:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
