[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 9. **Set the discriminant to zero and solve for $d$:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
