[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    d^2 = -256
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    This equation has no real solutions since $d^2$ is always non-negative.
