[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Since it does not specify further translation, we can consider the point closest to the two points encountered \( B \) and \( B' \), which is likely the closest origin or the immediate untouched point left after the transformations.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Thus, the closest origin image after such transformations is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \boxed{B': (3, 3)}
