[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Wow, that looks like a complex expression!
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Let's simplify the given logarithms step by step:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Given: $\log_2 2018 + \log_4 2018 + \log_8 2018 + \log_{64} 2018 = \log_x 2018$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Step 1: Use logarithm properties:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m &\left(\log_2 2018\right) + \left(\log_4 2018 \right) + \left(\log_8 2018 \right) + \left(\log_{64} 2018\right) \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m &= \log_2 2018 + \log_2 (2018^2) + \log_2 (2018^3) + \log_2 (2018^4) \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m &= \log_2 (2018^2 \cdot 2018^3 \cdot 2018^4) \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m &= \log_2 (2018^{(2+3+4)}) \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m &= \log_2 (2018^9).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Step 2: Rewrite the expression to make it match the desired form:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[\log_2 2018 + \log_4 2018 + \log_8 2018 + \log_{64} 2018 = \log_x 2018\]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Step 3: Rewrite the left side logarithm with base 2:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[2018^{\log_2 2018} = \log_2 2018\]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[2018^{\log_2 2018} = 1\]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m [Logarithm base 2 of 2018 equals 1]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Step 4: Set the given logarithm with base 2 equal to $\log_x 2018$:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[1 = \log_x 2018\]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Step 5: Solve for $x$:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[x = 10^1\]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ x = 10\]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, the value of $x$ is $\boxed{x = 10}$.<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
