[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m d = 13
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So, the length of the line segment is \(\boxed{13}\).<|endoftext|>
