[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Let $a,$ $b,$ $c,$ $p,$ $q,$ and $r$ be real numbers such that
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[\begin{vmatrix} p & b & c \\ a & q & c \\ a & b & r \end{vmatrix} = 0.\]Assuming that $a \neq p,$ $b \neq q,$ and $c \neq r,$ find the value of $\frac{p}{p - a} + \frac{q}{q - b} + \frac{r}{r - c}.$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To solve the given determinant equation, let's start by expanding and simplifying the determinant:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \begin{vmatrix} p & b & c \\ a & q & c \\ a & b & r \end{vmatrix} = 0
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m We will use the cofactor expansion along the first row:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m p \begin{vmatrix} q & c \\ b & r \end{vmatrix} - b \begin{vmatrix} a & c \\ a & r \end{vmatrix} + c \begin{vmatrix} a & q \\ a & b \end{vmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Calculating each 2x2 determinant:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \begin{vmatrix} q & c \\ b & r \end{vmatrix} = q \cdot r - c \cdot b
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \begin{vmatrix} a & c \\ a & r \end{vmatrix} = a \cdot r - c \cdot a = ar - ac = r(a - c)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \begin{vmatrix} a & q \\ a & b \end{vmatrix} = a \cdot b - a \cdot q = ab - aq = a(b - q)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Substituting these back into the determinant expansion:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m p (q \cdot r - c \cdot b) - b (r(a - c)) + c (a(b - q))
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Simplify each term:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m p (qr - cb) - b (ra - cb) + c (ab - qc)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Combine all terms:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m pqr - pcb - baq + cbra - cbq + cab - qc
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Group like terms:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m pqr - pbc + pcb - baq - cbq + cbra - qc
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Factor out common factors:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m pqr - cb(aq + br + qc)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Given the determinant is zero:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m pqr - cb(aq + br + qc) = 0
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Rearrange to isolate each term:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m pqr = cb(aq + br + qc)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Solve for \( \frac{p}{p - a} + \frac{q}{q - b} + \frac{r}{r - c} \):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \frac{p}{p - a} + \frac{q}{q - b} + \frac{r}{r - c} = \frac{c}{cq + br + qc} + \frac{a}{aq + br + qc} + \frac{b}{bq + br + qc}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Notice that the terms can be combined into a single fraction:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \frac{p}{p - a} + \frac{q}{q - b} + \frac{r}{r - c} = \frac{c + a + b}{cq + br + qc} = \frac{(a + b) + (c + b)}{cq + br + qc} = \frac{2b}{cq + br + qc}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Recognize that this simpler form simplifies to:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \frac{(a + b) + (c + b)}{cq + br + qc} = \frac{a + b + c + b}{cq + br + qc} = \frac{a + c + 2b}{cq + br + qc}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Since we need to simplify further, we can check the constants separately and combine them. However, we found:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \frac{p}{p - a} + \frac{q}{q - b} + \frac{r}{r - c} = \frac{a + b}{cq + br + qc}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Thus, the final answer is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \boxed{\frac{a + b}{cq + br + qc}}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
