[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. Let's denote the unknown number as x.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. According to the problem, five times the number (5x) is equal to twenty-one plus twice the number (x).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. Construct the equation:
