[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To solve this problem, we need to compute the sequence \(a_n\) defined by the given recursive formula with the initial conditions \(a_0 = 2, a_1 = 5, a_2 = 8\), and the recurrence relation \(a_{n} = \left(4a_{n-1} + 4a_{n-2} + 4a_{n-3}\right) \mod 11\). We will then find the product \(a_2018 \cdot a_2020 \cdot a_2022\).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Here are the steps:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
