[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. **Identify the periodicity of the sequence modulo 11:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Let's find the sequence modulo 11 for a few more terms to identify the pattern:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    a_10 & = 4(a_{10} + a_9 + a_8) \mod 11 = 4(3 + 9 + 1) \mod 11 = 4(13) \mod 11 = 52 \mod 11 = 3, \\
