[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Since \(a_{2020} \mod 11 = a_1 \mod 11 = 5\) and \(a_{2018} = a_3 \mod 11 = 3\), \(a_{2020} = a_7 \mod 11 = 9\).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    So,
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    a_{2018} \cdot a_{2020} = 3 \cdot 9 = 27.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    The product \(a_2018 \cdot a_2020 \cdot a_2022 = 27 \cdot 9 \cdot 3 = 729 \cdot 3 = 2187 \mod 11 = 6 \).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
