[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. Hyperbola parameters $a = 12$, $c = 15$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To square these, we use:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ a^2 = b^2 = c^2 \Rightarrow a^2 = 144 \qquad c^2 = 225\]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m This implies:
