[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m In how many ways can we form an international commission if we must choose one European country from among 6 European countries, one Asian country from among 4, one North American country from among 3, and one African country from among 7?
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To find the number of ways to form the international commission, we can use the formula for permutations of a multiset:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Permutations of a multiset = n! / (n1! * n2! * ... * nk!) 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Where:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - n is the total number of elements (in this case, 6 European countries)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - n1, n2, ..., nk are the counts of each type of element (in this case, 1 European, 4 Asian, 3 North American, and 7 African)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - ! denotes the factorial function (n!)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Plugging in the values, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Permutations of a multiset = 6! / (1! * 4! * 3! * 7!)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Calculating the factorial values:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 6! = 6 × 5 × 4 × 3 × 2 × 1 = 720
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1! = 1
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4! = 4 × 3 × 2 × 1 = 24
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3! = 3 × 2 × 1 = 6
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 7! = 7 × 6 × 5 × 4 × 3 × 2 × 1 = 5040
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Substituting these values back into the formula, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Permutations of a multiset = 720 / (1 * 24 * 6 * 5040)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Calculating the factorial values one more time:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Permutations of a multiset = 720 / (1 * 24 * 6 * 5040) = 720 / 72000
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Finally getting the answer:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Permutations of a multiset = 1/1080
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
