[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Find $73^{-1} \pmod{74}$, as a residue modulo 74.  (Give an answer between 0 and 73, inclusive.)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
