[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \frac{75}{16} = \frac{75 \times 5}{16 \times 5} = \frac{375}{80}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Now, we compare \(\frac{32}{80}\) and \(\frac{375}{80}\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \frac{32}{80} > \frac{375}{80}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    This means Kelsey ate more than Victor.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
