[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - One number above 38 is already accounted for using 2 sets that lie exactly as described. 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    So, total including those cleaned up accurately: 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    54 + 53 = 107
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. **Percent of palindromes with at least one 5:**
