[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Cancel \(\frac{1}{2^1}\) with \(\frac{1}{2^1}\), since \(\frac{1}{2^1} \cdot \frac{1}{2}^1 = \frac{1}{4} \neq \frac{1}{2^1}\).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Cancel \(\frac{4}{4}\) with \(\frac{4}{4 \cdot 4} = \frac{1}{16}\), since \(\frac{4}{4 \cdot 4} \cdot \frac{1}{4} = \frac{1}{2}\).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Cancel \(\frac{1}{8}\) with \(\frac{1}{8 \cdot 8} = \frac{1}{64}\), since \(\frac{1}{8} \cdot \frac{1}{8} = \frac{1}{64}\).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Continue this process until the denominator of \(\frac{512}{1} = 512\) becomes \(1024\).
