[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 5. **Simplify the series**:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Each term cancels out with the next term:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \frac{1}{2^1} \cdot \frac{4}{2^2} \cdot \frac{1}{2^3} \cdot \frac{4}{2^4} \cdot \frac{1}{2^5} \cdot \ldots \cdot \frac{1}{2^{511}} \cdot \frac{1}{2^{512}}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 6. **Combine the simplifications**:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
