[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Since \( D \) and \( E \) are midpoints, \( AD \) and \( BE \) are equal, and the triangles \( ABC \) and \( ADE \) are similar.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 7. **Relate the side lengths:**
