[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The normal vector to the plane will be the cross product of \(\vec{u}\), \(\vec{v}\), and \(\vec{w}\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \vec{n} = \vec{u} \times \vec{v} \times \vec{w}
