[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m First, we compute the cross product in \(\vec{n}\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \vec{n} = \begin{vmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \mathbf{i} & \mathbf{j} & \mathbf{k} \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m -3 & 1 & 1 \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1 & -1/2 & 1
