[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m = \mathbf{i} \left(1 \cdot 1 - 1 \cdot \left(-\frac{1}{2}\right)\right) - \mathbf{j} \left(-3 \cdot 1 - 1 \cdot \left(\frac{1}{2}\right)\right) + \mathbf{k} \left(-3 \cdot \left(-\frac{1}{2}\right) - 1 \cdot 1\right)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m = (-3 + \frac{1}{2})(\mathbf{i} - \mathbf{j} + \frac{1}{2}\mathbf{k})
