[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[\begin{pmatrix} -7 \\ -3 \\ 11 \end{pmatrix} + u \begin{pmatrix} -1 \\ 4 \\ 2 \end{pmatrix}\]are perpendicular.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
