[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m This can be rewritten in the form:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[115_{10} = a_{-1} \cdot (11^5 + 11^4 + 11^3 + 11^2 + 11^1 + 11^{31}) + a_{-10} \cdot 0 + a_{-11} \cdot 0 + a_{-10} \cdot (-11) + a_{-10} + a_{-9} \cdot 1\]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
