[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Since \(0 \le a_{i5}, a_{i4}, a_{i3}, a_{i2}, a_{i1}, a_i < 11\), it follows that:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[a_{-10} \cdot 0 + a_{-11} \cdot (-11) + a_{-10} + a_{-9} \cdot 1 \ge a_{-11} \cdot (-11) + a_{-10} \cdot 1 - a_{-9}\]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So, we can say that:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[115_{10} = a_{-1} \cdot 11^{14} + a_{-10} \cdot 0 + a_{-11} \cdot (-11) + a_{-10} + a_{-9}\]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[115_{10} = a_{-1} \cdot 11^{14} - 11a_{-11} - a_{-9}\]
