[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To match the example \(10 = A + 0 + 0 + 1 + 0\), we can choose \(a_{-11} = A\) and adjust it to \(a_{-11} = 0\). This simplifies to:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
