[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So, the final answer expressing it in terms of \( \pi \) is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \boxed{\pi (24)^2 - 2 \times 144\pi}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
