[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m First, let's simplify the left-hand side of the equation:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \frac{\left(\frac{x}{x+1}\right)^2 + 11}{\left(\frac{x}{x+1}\right)^2 + 1} = \frac{\left(\frac{x^2}{(x+1)^2} + 11\right)}{\left(\frac{x^2}{(x+1)^2} + 1\right)}
