[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Simplify the numerator and denominator:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \frac{x^2 + (x+1)^2 + 11}{x^2 + (x+1)^2 + 1}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Expand the terms:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
