[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So the equation becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \frac{2x^2 + 2x + 12}{2x^2 + 2x + 12 + 1}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, simplify the denominator:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
