[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, we can set the numerators equal to each other since the expression \(\frac{2x^2 + 2x + 12}{2x^2 + 2x + 13}\) is equal to 2 if the numerators are proportional:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
