[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - September (9th): 30 days
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - October (10th): 31 days
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - November (11th): 30 days
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - December (12th): 31 days
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. There are no "3" in the tens digit (3, 3, 0) in February, March, and April, which means that only in June, July, August, September, October, November, and December do "3" and "3" appear. In the years 1900-1999, for example, they appear in August, September, October, November, and December, but not in January unless it's not a leap year.
