[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To determine how many positive four-digit integers are divisible by \(8\), we need to understand the properties of numbers divisible by \(8\). A number is divisible by \(8\) if it can be expressed as \(8k\), where \(k\) is an integer, and \(8k\) is a four-digit number.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
