[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, there are \(\boxed{5556}\) positive four-digit integers that are divisible by \(8\).<|endoftext|>
