[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To compute \((17+10)^2-(17-10)^2\), we can break it down into smaller parts to make it easier to handle.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m First, let's simplify the terms inside the parentheses:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. Calculate \(17 + 10\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 17 + 10 = 27
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. Calculate \(17 - 10\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 17 - 10 = 7
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, substitute these values back into the expression:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m (27)^2 - (7)^2
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Next, we will use the difference of squares formula, \(a^2 - b^2 = (a+b)(a-b)\), where \(a = 27\) and \(b = 7\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m (27)^2 - (7)^2 = (27 + 7)(27 - 7)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Simplify the terms inside the parentheses:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 27 + 7 = 34
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 27 - 7 = 20
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, multiply the simplified terms:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 34 \times 20
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Calculate the product:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 34 \times 20 = 700
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, the final answer is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \boxed{700}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
