[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m This yields the intersection points \((5, -4)\) and \((10, 11)\).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m For \(y = 0\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
