[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. **Combining Constraints**:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Since \(AB = 60\) and \(CD = 60\), we can deduce the following:
