[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ H + L = 3.5 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ L = 3.5 - H \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Since Leah is 2.5 meters tall, we can find \( L \):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
