[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m It can be shown that for any positive integer $n,$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 1 \\ 1 & 0 \end{pmatrix}^n = \begin{pmatrix} F_{n + 1} & F_n \\ F_n & F_{n - 1} \end{pmatrix},\]where $F_n$ denotes the $n$th Fibonacci number.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Compute $F_{784} F_{786} - F_{785}^2.$
