[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[\begin{vmatrix} a & b & c \\ d & e & f \\ g & h & i \end{vmatrix} = a(ei - fh) - b(di - fg) + c(dh - eg)\]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Applying this formula to the given matrix:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[\begin{vmatrix} 0 & b - a & c - a \\ a - b & 0 & c - b \\ a - c & b - c & 0 \end{vmatrix} = 0\left(0 \cdot 0 - b \cdot b\right) - (b - a)\left(a - b \cdot 0 - c \cdot (a - c)\right) \hfill\] 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \begin{align}\hfill &
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m              = -(b - a)\left( a - b - a (a - c) \hfill\] \⊗& \hdashline
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m              = -(b - a)\left(b - a - ba + ac\right)\hfill\] \mathrm{\,true\,}} \end{align}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So \[\begin{vmatrix} 0 & b - a & c - a \\ a - b & 0 & c - b \\ a - c & b - c & 0 \end{vmatrix}=\begin{vmatrix} b - a & c - a & -b \\ a - b & c - b & 0 \\ a - c & b - c & 0 \end{vmatrix}=-\begin{vmatrix} b - a & c - a & -b \\ a - b & c - b & 0 \\ a - c & b - c & 0 \end{vmatrix}\]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now we can use the matrix of cofactors:
