[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m ```python
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m # Initialize the coefficient
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m coefficient = 0
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
