[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ \frac{1}{4} \times 2^{30} = 2^x \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m First, simplify the left-hand side:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ \frac{1}{4} \times 2^{30} = 2^{-3} \times 2^{30} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Since \( 2^{-3} \) is equal to \( \frac{1}{2^3} = \frac{1}{8} \), we can use this result:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
