[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - A list of such odd palindromic numbers:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m      \overline{10001, 10009, 10017, \ldots, 89993, 90001}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 5. **List even palindromic numbers in the same range:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - These numbers have the pattern \( \overline{aaabab} \).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - For \(10,000 \leq N \leq 70,000\), the first few terms of this pattern are:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m      \overline{12221, 12223, 12225, \ldots, 88887, 90009}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 6. **Sum of all valid palindromic numbers:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - To find the sum of even palindromes, we sum the terms in the pattern \( \overline{aaabab} \):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m     - For each \(a\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m       \[
