[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. **Express the projection formula**:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    The projection of vector \(\mathbf{v}\) onto vector \(\mathbf{w}\) is given by:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
