[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Since \(\mathbf{w} \cdot \mathbf{w} = 9^2 + 3^2 = 81 + 9 = 90\), we substitute \(\mathbf{v} \cdot \mathbf{w}\) into the projection formula:
