[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Sarah bought two t-shirts and one sweatshirt. The t-shirts cost $\$15.22$ each. If Sarah spent a total of $\$67.94,$ how many dollars did the sweatshirt cost? Express your answer as a decimal to the nearest hundredth.
