[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \log_{\log_2 256} 64 = \log_{\log_2 2^8} 64
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. Simplify further:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \log_{\log_2 2^8} 64 = \log_{\log_2 16} 64
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
