[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 5. Finally, reduce the exponent:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
