[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m c(a+b) = 170
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m First, let's add all three equations together:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
