[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m a^2(b+c) = 382
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Since \(ab + bc + ca = 382\), and knowing that \(ab + bc + ca = \frac{223992}{584}\), we focus on finding \(a^3\). Notice that \(a(ab + bc + ca) = 382\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m a^2 \cdot 382 = 382
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Thus:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
