[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m We also have \(a^2 = 1\), \(abc = x\), and \(ab + bc + ca = 382\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m x = b + c
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
