[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m A circle with center $C$ is shown. Express the area of the circle in terms of $\pi$. [asy]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m size(200); import graph; import markers; defaultpen(linewidth(0.7));
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m xaxis("$x$",-5,11,Arrows);
