[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m In the same triangle, take the vertex of the $\triangle D_1D_2D_3$ to be $V$. Should we increase or decrease the $\angle V_1D_2D_3$ angle by $180^{\circ}$ first or later? Provide a justification for your answer. To determine whether to increase or decrease the angle by 180° first or later, let's analyze the geometric properties and motion of the points.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
