[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. **Compute the Values and Check Symmetry:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Substitute \(x = 0\) into the equation to find the coordinates of the vertex of the parabola. Note that the given equation is symmetric with respect to the y-axis.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Compute \(x^2 - 50y^2\) at the vertex and compare it to the original equation to determine if it completes the equation of a parabola, circle, ellipse, hyperbola, or point.
