[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m In the diagram, the two triangles shown have parallel bases. What is the ratio of the area of the smaller triangle to the area of the larger triangle? Express your answer as a common fraction. [asy] path p = (0,0)--dir(-60)--dir(-120)--(0,0);
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m draw(p); draw(scale(3)*p);
