[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Expanding \((1-1)^2\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \|\mathbf{a} + \mathbf{b} + \mathbf{c}\|^2 = (\mathbf{a} + \mathbf{b} + \mathbf{c}) \cdot (\mathbf{a} + \mathbf{b} + \mathbf{c}).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Calculate the dot product:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \mathbf{a} \cdot (\mathbf{a} + \mathbf{b} + \mathbf{c}) = \mathbf{a} \cdot \mathbf{a} + \mathbf{a} \cdot \mathbf{b} + \mathbf{a} \cdot \mathbf{c}.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Substitute the magnitudes \(\|\mathbf{a}\|, \|\mathbf{b}\|, \|\mathbf{c}\|\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \mathbf{a} \cdot \mathbf{a} + \mathbf{a} \cdot \mathbf{b} + \mathbf{a} \cdot \mathbf{c} = 1 + \frac{1}{\sqrt{3}} \cdot \frac{1}{\sqrt{6}} + k \left( \frac{1}{\sqrt{3}} \cdot \frac{1}{\sqrt{6}} - \sqrt{k^2} \right).
