[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Simplify each term:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \mathbf{a} \cdot \mathbf{a} = 1, \quad \frac{1}{\sqrt{3}} \cdot \frac{1}{\sqrt{6}} = \frac{1}{\sqrt{18}} = \frac{1}{3\sqrt{2}}, \quad \sqrt{k^2} = k.
