[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, calculate \(\mathbf{a} \cdot \mathbf{b}\) and \(\mathbf{a} \cdot \mathbf{c}\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
