[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - $\sqrt{15} \approx 3.87$, $\lfloor \sqrt{15} \rfloor = 3$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m We can now calculate the sum as:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[1 + 1 + 1 + \cdots + 3 + 3 + 2 + 2 + 3 + 2 + 3 + 3 + 3 + 3 + 3 + 3 + \cdots + 3 + 3 + 1\]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[= (5 \times 1) + (5 \times 2) + (5 \times 3) + \cdots + (5 \times 3 + 1)\]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[= 5 \sum_{k=1}^{12} (2k-1)\]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[= 5 \times 66\]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[= 330\]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Let's implement this calculation in Python to confirm our result.
