[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To solve this system of equations, we will use the method of substitution to find the values of \(a\), \(b\), and \(c\). The given system of equations is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m b + c &= 12 - 3a \quad \text{(1)} \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m a + c &= -14 - 3b \quad \text{(2)} \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m a + b &= 7 - 3c \quad \text{(3)}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m First, solve equation (3) for \(a\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m a + b = 7 - 3c \implies a = 7 - 3c - b \quad \text{(4)}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Next, substitute equation (4) into equation (2):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m a + c = -14 - 3b
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m (7 - 3c - b) + c = -14 - 3b
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 7 - 3c - b + c = -14 - 3b
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 7 - 2c = -14 - 3b \quad \text{(5)}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, substitute equation (4) into the modified equation (5):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 7 - 2c = -14 - 3(7 - 3c - b)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 7 - 2c = -14 - 21 + 9c + 3b
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 7 - 2c = -35 + 9c - 3b
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 7 - 2c = -35 + 9c - 3b
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m -2c + 35 - 9c = -3b
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
