[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Let's start with the given equation:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \frac{4x}{20} = \frac{5}{x}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
