[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m y' = \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2} \left( 4 + 7\sqrt{3} \right) + \frac{1}{2} \left( 7 - 4\sqrt{3} \right) 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Let's calculate these step by step.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m For \( x' \):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m x' = \frac{1}{2} (4 + 7\sqrt{3}) - \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2} (7 - 4\sqrt{3}) 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m x' = \frac{4}{2} + \frac{7\sqrt{3}}{2} - \frac{7\sqrt{3}}{2} + \frac{4\sqrt{3} \cdot 3}{2}
