[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To determine the new coordinates of the point \((4 + 7\sqrt{3}, 7 - 4\sqrt{3})\) after a \(60^\circ\) counter-clockwise rotation about the origin, we can use the rotation transformations formula:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \begin{cases}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m x' = x \cos \theta - y \sin \theta \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m y' = x \sin \theta + y \cos \theta
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \end{cases}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m where \((x, y)\) is the original point, \((x', y')\) is the new point, and \((\cos \theta, \sin \theta)\) is the unit vector that represents the rotation.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m First, let's identify \(\cos \theta\) and \(\sin \theta\).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Given an angle of \(60^\circ\), we know:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \cos 60^\circ = \frac{1}{2} \quad \text{and} \quad \sin 60^\circ = \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Next, we substitute \(x = 4 + 7\sqrt{3}\) and \(y = 7 - 4\sqrt{3}\) into the rotation formulas:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m x' = x \cos \theta - y \sin \theta
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m y' = x \sin \theta + y \cos \theta
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m First, calculate \(\cos \theta\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \cos 60^\circ = \frac{1}{2}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, substitute \(x\) and \(y\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
