[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Since $(3!)!$ means $3! times 2$, we can rewrite the expression as:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \frac{3! \cdot 2!}3! = k \cdot n!
