[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Since $2!$ equals $2$, we can simplify further:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$
