[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Divide both sides by $2n$:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \frac{1}{n} = kn!
