[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. **Calculate the number of hands of Cheese Jack catches in a quarter of the year:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Each time Jack goes hunting, he catches 8Quantum Mouse 2s, and each time he goes hunting results in him gaining 10 Hands of Cheese. Therefore, the number of hands of Cheese Jack catches in a quarter is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
