[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. **Calculate the total number of hands of Cheese Jack gets in a year:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Since there are 4 quarters in a year, the total number of hands of Cheese Jack gets in a year is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    1.5 \text{ times/hour} \times 4 \text{ quarters/year} \times 10 \text{ hands/packet} = 1.5 \times 4 \times 10 = 60 \text{ hands/year}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Thus, the total number of hands of Cheese Jack gets in a year is \(\boxed{60}\).<|endoftext|>
