[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m First, we calculate the cross product:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \begin{pmatrix} 2 \\ a \\ -7 \end{pmatrix} \times \begin{pmatrix} 5 \\ 4 \\ b \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} a \cdot b - (-7) \cdot 4 \\ (-7) \cdot 5 - 2 \cdot b \\ 2 \cdot 4 - a \cdot 5 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Simplify the components:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m = \begin{pmatrix} a \cdot b + 28 \\ -7b - 2b \\ 8 - 5a \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m We are given that this result is equal to \(\mathbf{0}\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \begin{pmatrix} a \cdot b + 28 \\ -7b - 2b \\ 8 - 5a \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 0 \\ 0 \\ 0 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m This gives us the following system of equations:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. \(a b + 28 = 0\)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. \(-7b - 2b = 0\)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. \(8 - 5a = 0\)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Solve each equation from left to right:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m For the first equation:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m a b + 28 = 0
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
