[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m For the second equation:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m -7b - 2b = 0
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m -9 b = 0
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m b = 0
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Substitute \(b = 0\) into the third equation:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 8 - 5a = 0
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 5a = 8
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m a = \frac{8}{5}
