[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Find the inverse of the matrix
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[\begin{pmatrix} 2 & 3 \\ -1 & 7 \end{pmatrix}.\]If the inverse does not exist, then enter the zero matrix.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To find the inverse of a 2x2 matrix, we can use the formula:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ A^{-1} = \frac{1}{\text{det}(A)} \begin{pmatrix} d & -b \\ -c & a \end{pmatrix} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m where \( A = \begin{pmatrix} a & b \\ c & d \end{pmatrix} \).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Given the matrix:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ A = \begin{pmatrix} 2 & 3 \\ -1 & 7 \end{pmatrix} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m we first find the determinant (\( \text{det}(A) \)):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ \text{det}(A) = ad - bc = (2)(7) - (3)(-1) = 14 + 3 = 17 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Next, we use the formula to find the inverse:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ A^{-1} = \frac{1}{17} \begin{pmatrix} 7 & -3 \\ 1 & 2 \end{pmatrix} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So the inverse of the matrix is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ \boxed{\begin{pmatrix} \frac{7}{17} & -\frac{3}{17} \\ \frac{1}{17} & \frac{2}{17} \end{pmatrix}} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m If the determinant is zero, the matrix does not have an inverse. In this case, the determinant is zero.<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m [Ground Truth]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \begin{pmatrix} 7/17 & -3/17 \\ 1/17 & 2/17 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m [Is Boxed Matched]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m True
