[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m They say that
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m (x-f_1)(f_1-x-f_2)=0
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m together with
