[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 100 - 456.3 = -356.3
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Thus, the sum of the percent scores of the two missing grades is:
