[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m As we can see, the ones digit of $5^k$ is always 5 for any $k$ that is a multiple of 4. This means that the ones digits of $5^n$ repeat every 4 terms. 
