[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m In the figure, $\angle EAB$ and $\angle ABC$ are right angles, $AB=4,$ $BC=6,$ $AE=8,$ and $\overline{AC}$ and $\overline{BE}$ intersect at $D.$ What is the difference between the areas of $\triangle ADE$ and $\triangle BDC?$ [asy]
