[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The area of triangle $ABC$ can be found using Heron's formula, but we can also use the fact that 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \text{Area} \approx \frac{1}{2} \times AB \times BC \times \sin C
