[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m AB + BC = 17
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Substitute \(AB = 6\) and \(B = \frac{5}{C}\):
