[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 11 = 17
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m This is not correct, so let's re-evaluate the system. We already have \(AB = 6\) and \(BC = 5\). Let's try another approach by solving the system of equations:
