[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. Subtract 5 from both sides to isolate the term involving \( x \):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    5 - 4x - 5 > 0
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
