[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. Divide both sides by -4. Remember that dividing by a negative number reverses the inequality:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
