[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4. The inequality \( x < 0 \) means that \( x \) can be any number less than 0. The largest integer in this range is -1.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, the largest integer value of \( x \) that satisfies the inequality \( 5 - 4x > 17 \) is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
