[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The expression $64x^6-729y^6$ can be factored as $(ax+by)(cx^2+dxy+ey^2)(fx+gy)(hx^2+jxy+ky^2)$. If $a$, $b$, $c$, $d$, $e$, $f$, $g$, $h$, $j$, and $k$ are all integers, find their sum.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m We want to factor the given expression. 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The expression $64x^6-729y^6$ can be factored using the sum and difference formulas. 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m We can rewrite the expression as a sum of squares:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 64x^6-729y^6 &= (2^6x^6)-(81y^6) \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m &= (2^2x^2-3^2y^2)(2^4x^2-3^4y^2) \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m &= (4x^2-9y^2)(4x^2-9y^2) \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m &= (4x^2-9y^2)^2
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m However, we also have two $x$ terms and two $y$ terms from the original expression.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 64x^6-729y^6 &= 4x^2(-9y^2) + (-9y^2)(4x^2) \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m &= 4x^2(-9y^2-9y^2) \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m &= 4x^2(-18y^2) \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m &= -72x^2y^2
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now we can express the expression in the form we're looking for:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 64x^6-729y^6 &= (4x^2y^2 - 9y^2)(4x^2y^2 - 9y^2) \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m &= (4x^2y^2 - 9y^2)^2
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Thus, the factorization is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \boxed{(4x^2y^2 - 9y^2)^2}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m ####
