[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. **Calculate the number of correct answers:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - The number of correct answers is the total number of problems minus the number of incorrect answers.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Number of incorrect answers: \(5x - x = 4x\)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Number of correct answers: \(5x - 4x = x\)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. **Calculate the percentage of correct answers:**
