[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m What is the remainder when $6x^3-15x^2+21x-23$ is divided by $3x-6$?
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To find the remainder when \(6x^3 - 15x^2 + 21x - 23\) is divided by \(3x - 6\), we can use polynomial long division or synthetic division. Since the divisor \(3x - 6\) can be factored as \(3(x - 2)\), we will use synthetic division with the remainder.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. **Set up the division:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \begin{array}{r|rrrr}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m      3(x - 2) & 6 & -15 & 21 & -23 \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m          &    & 18 & 18 & 30 \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m      \hline
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m          &   &   & 3 & 0 \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \end{array}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. **Multiply by the divisor \(x - 2\):**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \begin{array}{r|rrrr}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m      3(x - 2) & 6 & -15 & 21 & -23 \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m              &    & 18 & 18 & 30 \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m        \hline
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m              &   &   & 3 & 0 \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \end{array}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    This gives us the coefficients of the remainder:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    0x^3 + 3x^2 - 10x - 11
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. **Substitute the values into the polynomial:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    The dividend is \(6x^3 - 15x^2 + 21x - 23\) and the divisor is \(3x - 6\). So, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    (6x^3 - 15x^2 + 21x - 23) + (-10x - 11)(x - 2)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4. **Simplify the remainder:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Simplify the expression:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    6x^3 - 15x^2 + 21x - 23 - 10x^2 + 20x + 22
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Combine like terms:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    6x^3 - 35x^2 + 41x - 1
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, the remainder when \(6x^3 - 15x^2 + 21x - 23\) is divided by \(3x - 6\) is \(\boxed{6x^3 - 35x^2 + 41x - 1}\).<|endoftext|>
