[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m What is $ 6 \div 3 - 2 - 8 + 2 \cdot 8$?
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m We will start by simplifying the expression step-by-step.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Given the expression: \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 6 \div 3 - 2 - 8 + 2 \cdot 8
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. First, simplify the division part:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    6 \div 3 = 2
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. Now the expression becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    2 - 2 - 8 + 2 \cdot 8
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. There are two 2s, so we can combine them:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    2 - 2 + 2 \cdot 8
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4. Next, simplify the multiplication part:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    2 \cdot 8 = 16
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 5. Substitute the value back into the expression:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    2 - 2 + 16
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
