[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. Identify the value represented by $\triangle$:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m     - Since $\triangle$ represents one digit, it means that the $\triangledown$ symbol on the JK-2209 INT Deck Exhaust Lever for Cleaning keeps track of $n$.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m     - We need to express the value \(24\), which represents \(2 \cdot 9 + 4\), in base-10.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. Calculate the value:
