[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 你好，这是个初等积分问题。
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 设 \( \frac{1}{(x - 1)(x - 2)} + \frac{1}{(x - 2)(x - 3)} + \frac{1}{(x - 3)(x - 4)} = \frac{1}{6} \)。
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 我们可以将天平视为实数的原子系统。我们可以开始从左边的分数开始，稍微离开分母。
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 首先，从左到右的四个分数都可以用加权形式。我们将将所有分数的分子乘以 5 并相加，因此我们可以得到：
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ \left( \frac{(x - 1)(x - 2) + (x - 2)(x - 3) + (x - 3)(x - 4)}{(x - 1)(x - 2)(x - 3)(x - 4)} \right) = \frac{1}{6} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 两边同时展开，并简化 \( x + 1 + x - 2 + x + 1 + x - 3 \)，我们得到：
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ (x - 2)(x - 3)(x - 4) + 5x(x - 2) = \frac{x+1 +(x-3)+(x-4)}{(x-1)(x-2)(x-3)(x-4)} = \frac{3x-6}{(x-1)(x-2)(x-3)(x-4)} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 因此，我们有方程：
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ (x-2)((x-2) + (x-3) + (x-4)) + 5x(x-2) = \frac{3x-6}{(x-1)(x-2)(x-3)(x-4)} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 进一步简化，
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ 4x^3 - 18x^2 + 20x - 24 + 5x^2 - 10x + 10 = \frac{3x-6}{(x-1)(x-2)(x-3)(x-4)} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ 4x^3 - 13x^2 + 5x - 14 = \frac{3x-6}{(x-1)(x-2)(x-3)(x-4)} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 整理可得：
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ 3x^3 - 13x^2 + 5x - 14 - (3x-6) = 0 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 简化得到：
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ 3x^3 - 13x^2 + x - 8 = 0 \]
