[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Kim's birthday was 200 days ago. Today is Wednesday. On what day of the week did his birthday fall?
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
