[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. Now, to solve \(2^8 \mod 5\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 204 \mod 5 = 4
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4. Therefore, the remainder of \(2^8\) when it is divided by 5 is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
