[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 7. **Since the denominator under each term is non-negative, we can simplify further by taking the square root (\(\sqrt{\frac{35}{9}} = \frac{\sqrt{35}}{3}\)):**
