[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. **Determine the size of the subsets**: The number of subsets we can form with 1 element from a set of 5 elements is given by \(2^5\). This is because each of the 5 elements can either be included in the subset or not included, giving us 2 choices per element.
