[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Welcome to Botpuzzles! We want to discuss the expression \[(15x^3+80x-5)-(-4x^3+4x-5).\]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Let's simplify it step by step:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. Distribute the negative sign inside the second set of parentheses:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m (15x^3 + 80x - 5) + (4x^3 - 4x + 5)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. Combine like terms:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The 80x in the first set can be combined with 4x^3 in the second set. When adding, we don't change the coefficient (80x) since 'x' is a variable:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 15x^3 + 4x^3 = 19x^3
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So now our expression looks like:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 19x^3 + 80x - 5 + 4x^3 - 4x + 5
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. Combine the \(x^3\) terms:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 19x^3 + 4x^3 = 23x^3
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4. Combine the \(x\) terms:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 80x - 4x = 76x
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So our expression now is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 23x^3 + 76x - 5 + 5
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 5. Combine the constants:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m -5 + 5 = 0
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Thus, our simplified expression is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
