[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Next, we need to find the fifth root of 12864. We can do this using a calculator or by manual calculation. Using a calculator:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
