[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Thus, the geometric mean of the set \(\{2, 7, 4, 19, 12\}\) is approximately 5.364. However, the problem asks for the largest number in the set, which is 12. Therefore, the largest number is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
