[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Step 2: Now, perform the multiplication. We need to multiply 3 by 4.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[3 \times 4 = 12\]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Step 3: Substitute these results back into the expression.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[2.4 + 12 - 7\]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Step 4: Perform the addition and subtraction from left to right.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m First, add 2.4 and 12.
