[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    f(5) = \frac{6}{11}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, the value of \( f(5) \) is:
