[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Joe has 60 balls. Some are red, and some are blue. The rest of the balls are yellow. Joe has 10 red balls and 8 blue balls. What percentage of the balls are blue?
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To determine the percentage of blue balls in the collection, we need to follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. Calculate the number of yellow balls.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. Add up all the counted balls to get the total number of balls.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. Determine the percentage of blue balls out of the total number of balls.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m From the given information:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - Total balls = 60.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - Red balls = 10.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - Blue balls = 8.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, we can calculate the number of yellow balls:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ \text{Yellow balls} = \text{Total balls} - (\text{Red balls} + \text{Blue balls}) \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Using the previously calculated values:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ \text{Yellow balls} = 60 - (10 + 8) = 60 - 18 = 42 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Next, to find the percentage of blue balls out of the total balls:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ \text{Percentage of blue balls} = \left(\frac{\text{Blue balls}}{\text{Total balls}}\right) \times 100 \% \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Let's calculate this using Python:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m ```python
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m # Given values
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m total_balls = 60
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m red_balls = 10
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m blue_balls = 8
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m # Calculate the number of yellow balls
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m yellow_balls = total_balls - (red_balls + blue_balls)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
