[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m **Part (I)**: If \(a_4 = 8\), find \(a_5\).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m From the recursive relation \(a_n + 1 = 2a_{n-1}\), we substitute \(a_4\) to get:
