[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m We want to find the maximum value of \(a_{n+1}\) when the inequality \(\left(\frac{1}{2}\right)^{a_n} > \left(\frac{1}{3}\right)^{a_{n+1}}\) holds for all \(n\). Let's substitute the expression for \(a_{n+1}\) into the inequality:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[\left(\frac{1}{2}\right)^{a_n} > \left(\frac{1}{3}\right)^{\frac{a_n + 1}{2}}.\]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m This can be rewritten as:
