[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Substitute \(u = 2 - t\) into Equation 2:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 5(2 - t) - 4(2 - t) = 4
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Simplify the equation:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 10 - 5t - 8 + 4t = 4
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Combine like terms:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2 - t = 4
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Solve for \(t\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
