[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Suppose $\cos R = \frac{4}{9}$ in the diagram below.  What is $QS$?
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m [asy]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m pair Q,R,S;
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m S = (0,0);
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Q = (sqrt(65),0);
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m R = (sqrt(65),-4);
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m draw(S--Q--R--S);
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
