[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. **Find the value of \(\left[f^{-1}(2)\right]^{-2}\):**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Now, we need to evaluate \(\left[f^{-1}(2)\right]^{-2}\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
