[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Alexia designed a logo 2 inches wide and 1.5 inches tall to be used on her school's notebooks. The school wants the logo on the notebook to be 8 inches wide. How tall, in inches, will it be if it is enlarged proportionately?
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To determine the height of the enlarged logo, we need to apply the same scaling factor to both the width and the height of the logo. Here's the step-by-step process:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. **Identify the original dimensions of the logo:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Width = 2 inches
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Height = 1.5 inches
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. **Determine the scaling factor for the width:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Enlarged height = 8 inches
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. **Calculate the enlargement factor for the width:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \text{Enlarged width} = 2 \text{ inches} + \left(\frac{8 \text{ inches}}{2 \text{ inches}}\right) = 2 \text{ inches} + 4 \text{ inches} = 6 \text{ inches}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4. **Calculate the new height:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \text{New height} = 1.5 \text{ inches} \times \frac{8 \text{ inches}}{6 \text{ inches}} = 1.5 \text{ inches} \times \frac{4}{3} = 2 \text{ inches}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, the new height of the logo, when enlarged proportionately, will be \boxed{2} inches.<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m [Ground Truth]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 6
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
