[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m When a fair six-sided die is tossed on a table top, the bottom face cannot be seen.  What is the probability that the product of the  numbers on the five faces that can be seen is divisible by 6?
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
