[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To find the area of the square, we first need to determine the length of one side of the square. We do this by calculating the distance between any two opposite vertices, such as $A$ and $C$.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The distance formula is given by:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m d = \sqrt{(x_2 - x_1)^2 + (y_2 - y_1)^2}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m We will calculate the distance between:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m A(0, 0), \quad B(-5, -1)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Substituting the coordinates into the distance formula, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m A(0, 0), \quad B(-5, -1)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m d = \sqrt{(-5 - 0)^2 + (-1 - 0)^2} = \sqrt{(-5)^2 + (-1)^2} = \sqrt{25 + 1} = \sqrt{26}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now that we have the side length of the square, we can calculate its area. The area of a square is given by:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \text{Area} = \text{side} \times \text{side}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Let’s use \(\sqrt{26}\) as our side length:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \text{Area} = (\sqrt{26}) \times (\sqrt{26}) = 26
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Thus, the area of the square in square units is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \boxed{26}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
