[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m What is $123_{10}$ when expressed in base $5$?
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To convert the decimal number \(123_{10}\) to base-5, we need to repeatedly divide the number by 5 and record the remainder, effectively forming the base-5 digits from the quotients.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Let's start with the number \(123_{10}\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. Divide \(123\) by \(5\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    123 \div 5 = 24 \text{ remainder } 3
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    So, the least significant digit (rightmost) in base-5 is \(3\).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. Now take the quotient \(24\) and divide it by \(5\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    24 \div 5 = 4 \text{ remainder } 4
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    So, the next digit in base-5 is \(4\).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. Finally, take the quotient \(4\) and divide it by \(5\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    4 \div 5 = 0 \text{ remainder } 4
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    So, the most significant digit (leftmost) in base-5 is \(4\).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Putting these results together, we get the base-5 representation of \(123_{10}\) as \(443_5\).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, the answer is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \boxed{443}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m [Ground Truth]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 443_5
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m [Is Boxed Matched]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m True
