[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Divisors: 1, 5, 25.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Only divisors: 1, 5.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Hence, 25 is not a prime number.
