[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Divisors: 1, 3, 9, 27.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Only divisors: 1, 3, 9.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - And 27 is a square number, which is not a prime number.
