[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. Arithmetic mean:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \frac{44}{3}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So, the arithmetic mean of the prime numbers in the list is:
