[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - The second term \( a_2 = -6 \),
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - The common ratio \( r \) cannot be determined without additional terms, so let's assume \( r \) is the common ratio of the sequence.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m We are asked to find the 205th term. Plugging in the known values:
