[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ a_{205} = 6 \cdot 1^{204} = 6 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So, if \( r = 1 \), the 205th term is 6.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To ensure this is the correct value, let's check if \( r = -1 \) (since all other common ratios should be \( \pm 1 \)):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m If \( r = -1 \):
