[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, we have verified that if \( r = 1 \), the 205th term is indeed 6. 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m For any other valid common ratio \( r \), simply multiply 6 by \( r^{204} \) to find the 205th term.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
