[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Similarly,
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \cos 36^\circ \cos 86^\circ = \frac{1}{2} \left(2 \cos 36^\circ \cos 86^\circ\right) = \cos 36^\circ \cos 86^\circ
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Substitute these into the expression:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
