[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To expand the expression $(z^2 - 3z + 2)(z^3 + 4z - 2)$, we will use the distributive property (also known as the FOIL method for binomials but extended to more terms) and multiply each term in the first polynomial by each term in the second polynomial.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Expanding step-by-step:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. Distribute each term in $z^2 - 3z + 2$ to each term in $z^3 + 4z - 2$:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - First: $z^2 \cdot z^3 = z^5$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Second: $z^2 \cdot 4z = 4z^3$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Third: $z^2 \cdot (-2) = -2z^2$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - First: $-3z \cdot z^3 = -3z^4$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Second: $-3z \cdot 4z = -12z^2$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Third: $-3z \cdot (-2) = 6z$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Fourth: $2 \cdot z^3 = 2z^3$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Fifth: $2 \cdot 4z = 8z$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Sixth: $2 \cdot (-2) = -4$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. Combine all the terms:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    z^5 + 4z^3 - 2z^2 - 3z^4 - 12z^2 + 6z + 2z^3 + 8z - 4
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. Combine like terms:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    z^5 + (-3z^4 + 2z^3) + (-2z^2 - 12z^2 + 2z^3) + (6z + 8z) - 4
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Simplify each group:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    z^5 - 3z^4 + 2z^3 - 14z^2 + 14z - 4
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Thus, the expanded form of $(z^2 - 3z + 2)(z^3 + 4z - 2)$ is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \boxed{z^5 - 3z^4 + 2z^3 - 14z^2 + 14z - 4}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
