[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m First, let's list the divisors of 840 and 1008:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - Divisors of 840: 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 10, 12, 14, 15, 16, 20, 21, 24, 28, 30, 35, 36, 40, 42, 48, 50, 60, 63, 70, 72, 84, 90, 100, 120, 126, 140, 150, 168, 200, 210, 252, 300, 336, 420, 480, 504, 600, 720, 840, 1260, 2520, 4200
