[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, let's find the common divisors of 840 and 1008:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Common divisors: 1, 2, 4, 3, 6, 8, 9, 12, 16, 18, 24, 36, 48, 72, 144
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
