[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. Calculate the total earnings from berry smoothies:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Michael sold 20 berry smoothies.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Each smoothie is sold for $3.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Total earnings from smoothies = \( 20 \times 3 = 60 \) dollars.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. Calculate the total earnings from coffeecoffeemakers:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Michael sold 10 coffeecoffeemakers.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Each coffeemaker is sold for $5.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Total earnings from coffeemakers = \( 10 \times 5 = 50 \) dollars.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. Calculate the total earnings before subtracting the cost price:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Total earnings before = \( 60 + 50 = 110 \) dollars.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4. Calculate the total profit:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - Since Michael received $110 from the smoothies and coffeecoffeemakers, which are his total earnings without subtracting the cost price, the profit is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \text{Profit} = 110 - 110 = 0 \text{ dollars}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, the total profit that Michael made is \(\boxed{0}\).
