[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Next, simplify the subtraction and addition step by step:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ 400 - 60 = 340 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ 340 + 5 = 345 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ 417 + N = 345 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To isolate $N$, we subtract 417 from both sides of the equation:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ N = 345 - 417 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ N = -72 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, the value of $N$ is:
