[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. **Identify the conjugate of \(10 - \sqrt{2018}\):**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    The radical conjugate of \(a - \sqrt{b}\) is \(a + \sqrt{b}\). Therefore, the radical conjugate of \(10 - \sqrt{2018}\) is \(10 + \sqrt{2018}\).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. **Subtract the radical conjugate from \(10 - \sqrt{2018}\):**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    We perform the subtraction directly:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    (10 - \sqrt{2018}) - (10 + \sqrt{2018})
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. **Combine like terms:**
