[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    10 - 10 - \sqrt{2018} + \sqrt{2018}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4. **Simplify the expression:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    The \(-\sqrt{2018}\) terms cancel each other out:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    0 - \sqrt{2018}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Simplifying further, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    -\sqrt{2018}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, the sum of the number \(10 - \sqrt{2018}\) and its radical conjugate is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \boxed{-\sqrt{2018}}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
