[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[\bold{w} = \begin{pmatrix} 8 \\ -1 \\ -1 \end{pmatrix} + u \begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ -4 \\ 0 \end{pmatrix}\]intersect at a point.  Find the point of intersection.
