[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Let $a = \frac{\pi}{2008}$. Find the smallest positive integer $n$ such that
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[\sum_{k = 1}^n 2 \cos (k^2 a) \sin (ka)\]is an integer.
