[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, we need to check if 9999 is divisible by 4. To do this, we can perform a divisibility test.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Divisibility rule for 4: A number is divisible by 4 if the last two digits form a number divisible by 4.
