[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 18 is divisible by 4.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Since 9999 is divisible by 4, it is indeed the largest four-digit number that is divisible by 4.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
