[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Given that green balls and red balls together weigh 10 pounds, and 1 green ball and 4 red balls together weigh 7 pounds, we first need to determine the weights of the individual items.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Let weight of one green ball be \( g \) pounds, and the weight of one red ball be \( r \) pounds.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m We set up the following system of equations:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ g + r = 10 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ g + 4r = 7 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Subtract the first equation from the second to eliminate \( g \):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ (g + 4r) - (g + r) = 7 - 10 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ 3r = -3 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m This indicates an error here. The correct steps should be:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ 3r = 3 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ r = 1 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, substitute \( r = 1 \) back into the first equation to find \( g \):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ g + 1 = 10 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ g = 9 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Thus, the weights are:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \(\boxed{9 \text{ pounds for the green balls and 1 pound for the red balls}}\)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To find the total weight of 8 red and 8 green balls together, we calculate:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ (7 \text{ pounds per red ball} \times 8) + (9 \text{ pounds per green ball} \times 8) \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ = 56 + 72 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ = 128 \text{ pounds} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, the weight of 8 red and 8 green balls together is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \boxed{128} pounds.<|endoftext|>
