[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ \frac{x^2}{a^2} - \frac{y^2}{b^2} = 1 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m if we let \(a^2 = 3\) and \(b^2 = 1\), then the equation becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ \frac{x^2}{3} - \frac{y^2}{1} = 1 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
