[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. **Rewrite the equation for clarity:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \sqrt[3]{20x + \sqrt[3]{20x + 13}} = 13
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. **Eliminate the cube roots by cubing both sides:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    (\sqrt[3]{20x + \sqrt[3]{20x + 13}})^3 = 13^3
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    This simplifies to:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    20x + \sqrt[3]{20x + 13} = 13^3
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. **Calculate \(13^3\):**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    13^3 = 13 \times 13 \times 13 = 2197
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4. **Write the equation with 13 as a cube root:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    20x + \sqrt[3]{20x + 13} = 2197
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 5. **Isolate the cube root term:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \sqrt[3]{20x + 13} = 2197 - 20x
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 6. **Cube both sides again to eliminate the cube root:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    (\sqrt[3]{20x + 13})^3 = (2197 - 20x)^3
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    This simplifies to:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    20x + 13 = (2197 - 20x)^3
