[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 7. **Expand the right-hand side using the binomial theorem:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    (2197 - 20x)^3 = 2197^3 - 3 \cdot 2197^2 \cdot (20x) + 3 \cdot 2197 \cdot (20x)^2 - (20x)^3
