[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 8. **Rearrange the equation to form a standard polynomial equation:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    26383200x^2 - 800x^3 - 2637317440x + 2639034 = 0
