[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To solve the equation $\dfrac{r+9}{r-3} = \dfrac{r-2}{r+5}$ for $r$, we will cross-multiply and solve the resulting equation completely.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Starting with:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \dfrac{r+9}{r-3} = \dfrac{r-2}{r+5}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Cross multiply to eliminate the fractions:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m (r+9)(r+5) = (r-2)(r-3)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Distribute both sides:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m r^2 + 14r + 45 = r^2 - 5r + 6
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Next, we'll isolate $r^2$ by subtracting $r^2$ from both sides:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 14r + 45 = -5r + 6
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Add $5r$ to both sides to combine like terms:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 19r + 45 = 6
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Subtract 45 from both sides:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 19r = 6 - 45
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Simplify the right-hand side:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 19r = -39
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Divide both sides by 19:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m r = \dfrac{-39}{19}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Thus, the solution to the equation is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m r = -\dfrac{39}{19}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
