[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Simplifying this:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 290^{\circ} + \angle NQR = 180^{\circ}
