[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m This is incorrect, so we need to correct our steps. Let's use the missing $\angle NQR$ from $\angle PRQP$:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \angle PRQP = \angle PRQ + \angle NQR
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Since $\angle NQR$ is part of $\angle NRP$, we can use the fact that $\angle PRQP = \angle PRQ$:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \angle PRQP = \angle PRQ + 180^{\circ} - \angle PRQ = \angle PRQ + 180^{\circ} - \angle PRQ
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
