[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The angles of quadrilateral $ABCD$ satisfy  $\angle A = 2\angle B =
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3\angle C = 4\angle D$.  What is the degree measure of $\angle A$, rounded to the nearest whole number?
