[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Solving the quadratic equation:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    u = \frac{-b \pm \sqrt{b^2 - 4ac}}{2a} = \frac{-16 \pm \sqrt{16^2 - 4(-3)(3153)}}{2(-3)}
