[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    u = \frac{501.8}{-6} = -83.6333 \quad \text{(not valid)}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    u = \frac{-541.8}{-6} = 90.3
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    x^2 = 90.3 \implies x = \pm \sqrt{90.3} \quad \text{(valid)}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Substituting \(x = \sqrt{90.3}\) back into \(y = 3x^2\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
