[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    P = (\sqrt{90.3}, 270.9)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Alternatively, since the focus is at \((0, \frac{1}{4})\), the point must be at a height of \(\frac{3}{4}\) unit (since the distance from the focus to the vertex is \(\frac{1}{4}\)), so the final point is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
