[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. **Subtract the original equation \(x = 0.72\overline{6}\) from this new equation:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    10x - x = 7.2666\ldots - 0.72
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4. **Simplify the left-hand side:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
