[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 5. **Convert \(6.5466\ldots\) back into a fraction:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    6.5466\ldots = 6 + 0.5466\ldots
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Since \(0.5466\ldots = 0.5 + 0.0466\ldots = 0.5 + 0.34272571\ldots\), we can approximate \(0.5466\ldots\) as \(0.5 + 0.34272571\ldots\).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 6. **Combine the fractions:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
