[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. **Apply the absolute value:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    |-5| = 5
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So, the expression \( |-3^2 + 4| \) simplifies to \(\boxed{5}\).<|endoftext|>
