[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Suppose we want to divide the 10 dogs into three groups, one with 3 dogs, one with 5 dogs, and one with 2 dogs.  How many ways can we form the groups such that Fluffy is in the 3-dog group and Nipper is in the 5-dog group?
