[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To determine the type of curve represented by the equation \( y^2 - x + 5y - 25 = 0 \), we will follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. **Rewrite the equation in standard form**:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    We start by moving the constant term on the right side to the left side.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    y^2 - x + 5y - 25 - 5y + 25 = 0
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Simplify by combining like terms:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    y^2 - x + 5y - 5y - 25 + 25 = 0
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
