[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. **Identify the type of curve**:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    The equation \( y^2 - x = 0 \) is in the form \( y^2 - kx = 0 \), which is a parabola when rewritten in the standard form \( y^2 = 4kx \).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, the graph of the equation \( y^2 - x + 5y - 25 = 0 \) is a **parabola**.
