[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m      These multiples are: 60, 120, 180, ...
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4. **Identify the two-digit positive integer:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - From the multiples, we can see that the smallest two-digit positive integer that is one more than a multiple of 60 is 120.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
