[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To solve this problem, we need to consider the three-digit whole numbers where neither the thousands, hundreds, nor tens place can contain a digit of 7 or 9. We can break this down into specific ranges for the hundreds and tens places.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m ### Step-by-Step Solution:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
