[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To simplify the expression \( |-3^2 + 4| \), we will follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. **Evaluate the inner expression inside the absolute value:**
