[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. **Substitute \( 3^2 \) back into the expression:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    -3^2 + 4 = -9 + 4
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4. **Perform the addition:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
