[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 5. **Take the absolute value of the result:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    |-5| = 5
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 6. **Combine the absolute value with the original expression:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    |-3^2 + 4| = |5|
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 7. **Simplify the absolute value \( |5| \):**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    |5| = 5
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, the simplified form of the expression \( |-3^2 + 4| \) is \(\boxed{5}\).<|endoftext|>
