[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \text{New average} = \frac{\text{New total weight for 6 weights}}{6} = \frac{78 \text{ grams}}{6} = 13 \text{ grams}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
