[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ x + 2 = 2w - 4 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Dividing by 2 to simplify:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ \frac{x + 2}{2} = w - 2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Rewriting:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ x + 2 = 2w - 4 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ 2w = 2x + 6 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ w = x + 3 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Then,
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ x + 2 = 2(x + 3) - 4 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Isolate \( x \):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ x + 2 = 2x + 6 - 4 \]
