[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, we can find the value of \( f(0) + f(3) \):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m f(0) + f(3) = 2 + 5 = 7
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, the value of \( f(0) + f(3) \) is \(\boxed{7}\).<|endoftext|>
