[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m One fair die has faces 1, 1, 2, 2, 3, 3 and another has faces 4, 4, 5, 5, 6, 6. The dice  are rolled and the numbers on the top faces are added. What is the probability that the sum will be odd?
