[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m In the figure shown, arc $ADB$ and arc $BEC$ are semicircles, each with a radius of one unit. Point $D$, point $E$ and point $F$ are the midpoints of arc $ADB$, arc $BEC$ and arc $DFE$, respectively. If arc $DFE$ is also a semicircle, what is the area of the shaded region?
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
