[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m First, expand \(\left(3p+9\right)\left(7p-11\right)\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \left(3p+9\right)\left(7p-11\right) = 3p \cdot 7p + 3p \cdot (-11) + 9 \cdot 7p + 9 \cdot (-11) = 21p^2 - 33p + 63p - 99 = 21p^2 + 30p - 99.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Next, expand \(\left(3p+9\right)(p-8)\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \left(3p+9\right)(p-8) = 3p \cdot p + 3p \cdot (-8) + 9 \cdot p + 9 \cdot (-8) = 3p^2 - 24p + 9p - 72 = 3p^2 - 15p - 72.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Finally, expand \(\left(10-3p\right)(7p-11)\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \left(10-3p\right)(7p-11) = 10 \cdot 7p + 10 \cdot (-11) - 3p \cdot 7p - 3p \cdot (-11) = 70p - 110 - 21p^2 + 33p = -21p^2 + 103p - 110.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, add the expanded terms together:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 21p^2 + 30p - 99 + 3p^2 - 15p - 72 - 21p^2 + 103p - 110 = (21p^2 + 3p^2 - 21p^2) + (30p - 15p + 103p) + (-99 - 72 - 110) = 30p + 126.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Thus, the value of the expression is \(\boxed{30p + 126}\).
