[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. **Using Midpoints and Properties:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - The midpoints \(D\), \(E\), and \(F\) create several equal segments within the triangle.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - The point \(Q\) is the midpoint of \(\overline{BE}\), and the point \(R\) is the midpoint of \(\overline{CF}\).
