[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - The line segments from the centroid (the intersection of the medians) to the vertices are also equal, hence these segments on the sides of the triangle are of length half the lengths of the opposite side.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4. **Using Triangles \(APD\), \(BPD\), and \(CRD\):**
