[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - The triangles \(APD\), \(BPD\), and \(CRD\) angles are related to the internal angles of the triangle.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 5. **Solving the Ratio:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - By examining the structure carefully and using the properties of midpoints and the acute angles, we can deduce that the ratios sum to 1 due to the symmetry and equal division of segments.
