[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To solve the equation \(\frac{r+9}{r-3} = \frac{r-2}{r+5}\), we can start by eliminating the denominators by cross-multiplying:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
