[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 14r + 45 = -r + 6.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Adding \(r\) to both sides, we get:
