[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Step 2: Notice that $203$ also has a common factor with $23x^5$.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 203x^{11} = 23x^5 \cdot \left(\frac{203}{23x^5}\right)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Step 3: Combine the factorizations of the terms and simplify the expression.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
