[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Step 4: Calculate the product of the common factor.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
