[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Find the product of all real values of $y$ such that  $|{-2y}|\cdot\left|{-\dfrac{y}{2}}\right| = 36$.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
