[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m c = 2
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m For the second entry:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m d = 3
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Thus, the ordered pair \((c, d)\) is:
