[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    x \approx \$8333.33
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, the cost to buy 2500 pencils is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
