[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Let's calculate this step by step:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ \text{Total permutations} = 4^4 = 256 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ \text{Words excluding A} = 3^3 = 27 \]
