[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m stown, Pennsylvania (CNN) -- Authorities on Tuesday announced on an arrest warrant brief that the toddler died falling from a remote rock shelter Friday while diving into a pile of sawdust that's off limits to guests, police said. 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m  The toddler, 3 months old, was on his way to a crib in the center of the rock shelter. Something went wrong as the door was opened for experimentation, police said. The door, belonging to a young boy's mom, might have also been defaced or torn, prompting police to intervene. 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m  "It looks like it was done like a game, where somebody was just out there trying to play with the little boy, but then this thing gets set off, ends up spreading under somebody's feet. They fall ... and they fall," Permute department chief Rick Herron told CNN, describing the line of action. 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m  The preschool attendee also got hurt by another young boy, he said. The boy actually fell down the stairs and was injured in the process, but he was heading toward a safer part of the rock shelter. 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m  His sister remembered what happened last Wednesday when a young child fell in the earlier days of the rock shelter program. She identified the girl by name. 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m  "She went out there looking for something," Herron said. "She tell me, I made a path, and I have to find something to reach this edge and make, and she says go by that edges..... and she says I got this shovel." 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m  "And I said "Ok, let me get this pickup shovel" I said "Pull up this line, and make sure I go out there'See, women had been lucky to be in those spaces for hours, that's what it was." 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m  When the official information came in last week, others who stayed in the rock shelter checked in again and found that the 3-month-old friend had not died. 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m  "They knew just how a parent would act," Herron said. 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m  "This is a present day, or near pres, a present day. Schools are re-forming, raise families, no longer going to the pre-school, our thoughts are with them." Steele possibly died from Barrett's syndrome, a rare disease. 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m  Barbaray's syndrome is difficult to diagnose because toddlers have rather featureless faces until the age of 2. Symptoms, including loss of normal movement patterns and restricted use of the tongue, show up after the third year. 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m  Children who do get the disease are told that the symptoms worsen over time and can't be completely cured, though no one knows why. Research efforts include discovering the cause and finding better ways to treat it. 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m  Early rehabilitation efforts for the toddler may also have involved a bone marrow test. Â Researchers at the University of Michigan tested to see if the toddler was follicular lymphomous disease, a rare, aggressive type of cancer believed to be connected to dental enamel defects, at autopsy. 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m  "I suspect they didn't have the symptoms of Bhaltson's disease," Herron said. "And I believe her to be the diagnosis for how she's received for the last 7 [months]." 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m   
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m  In general, toddlers in the program are on average ready to regress after one year. The adult leads in helping to care for toddlers. 
