[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Let $a_1,a_2,a_3,\dots$ be an arithmetic sequence. If $\frac{a_4}{a_2} = 3$, what is $\frac{a_5}{a_3}$?
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
