[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4. Combining \(1, 2, 3, 4, 8\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - \(1 + 2 + 3 + 4 + 8 = 18\)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 5. Combining \(1, 2, 3, 4, 9\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - \(1 + 2 + 3 + 4 + 9 = 19\)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 6. Combining \(1, 2, 5, 4, 6\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - \(1 + 2 + 5 + 4 + 6 = 18\) (only one combination: \(1 + 2 + 5 + 4 + 6 = 21\))
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 7. Combining \(1, 2, 5, 6, 6\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - \(1 + 2 + 5 + 6 + 6 = 20\)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 8. Combining \(1, 2, 5, 8, 4\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - \(1 + 2 + 5 + 8 + 4 = 20\)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 9. Combining \(1, 2, 5, 9, 4\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - \(1 + 2 + 5 + 9 + 4 = 27\)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 10. Combining \(1, 4, 5, 11, 6\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m     - \(1 + 4 + 5 + 11 + 6 = 27\)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m     - \(2 + 5 + 11 + 6 = 28\) (only one combination: \(2 + 5 + 11 + 6 = 24\))
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
