[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m     - \(1 + 4 + 5 + 10 + 6 = 26\)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m     - \(2 + 5 + 10 + 6 = 23\) (only one combination: \(2 + 5 + 10 + 6 = 23\))
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 12. Combining \(1, 4, 6, 8, 7\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m     - \(1 + 6 + 8 + 7 + 4 = 28\)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 13. Combining \(2, 3, 6, 8, 8\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m     - \(2 + 3 + 6 + 8 + 8 = 29\) (only one combination: \(2 + 3 + 6 + 8 + 8 = 31\))
