[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 15. Combining \(3, 4, 7, 8, 8\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m     - \(3 + 4 + 7 + 8 + 8 = 33\) (only one combination: \(3 + 4 + 7 + 8 + 8 = 33\))
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Thus, the number of increasing lists of five different single-digit positive integers that sum to 33 is \(\boxed{15}\).<|endoftext|>
