[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \end{vmatrix} = -1 \cdot ((4)(-3) - (5)(3)) = -1 \cdot (-12 - 15) = -33.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The cofactor \(C_{22}\) is
