[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \end{vmatrix} = -1 \cdot ((-3)(3) - (4)(0)) = -9.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The cofactor \(C_{31}\) is
