[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m C_{32} = (-1)^{3+2} \begin{vmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m -3 & 5 \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m -4 & 2 \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \end{vmatrix} = -1 \cdot ((-3)(2) - (5)(-4)) = -1 \cdot (-6 + 20) = 14.
