[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To express \( (4-5i)(-5+5i) \) in the form \( a + bi \), we will use the distributive property (also known as the FOIL method for binomials):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m (a + b)(c + d) = ac + ad + bc + bd
