[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Let's perform the calculations step by step:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. **Multiply the real parts:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    4 \times (-5) = -20
