[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4. **Add the results of the imaginary parts together:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    20 + (-25) = -5
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Combining these results, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m (4-5i)(-5+5i) = 0 + (-5i) = -5i
