[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ x = 6 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So, the number is \(\boxed{6}\).<|endoftext|>
