[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Find $\csc 330^\circ.$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To find \(\csc 330^\circ\), we start by recognizing that this is the cotangent of \(-30^\circ\). The cotangent is the reciprocal of the tangent, so we need to find \(\tan 30^\circ\).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m We know from trigonometric values of common angles that:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \tan 30^\circ = \frac{1}{\sqrt{3}}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The cosecant is the reciprocal of the sine, so we have:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \csc 330^\circ = \frac{1}{\sin 330^\circ}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Next, we know that:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \sin 330^\circ = \sin (360^\circ - 30^\circ) = -\sin 30^\circ
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Since \(\sin 30^\circ = \frac{1}{2}\), it follows that:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \sin 330^\circ = -\frac{1}{2}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now we can find \(\csc 330^\circ\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \csc 330^\circ = \frac{1}{\sin 330^\circ} = \frac{1}{-\frac{1}{2}} = -2
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, the value of \(\csc 330^\circ\) is \(\boxed{-2}\).<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m [Ground Truth]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m -2
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
