[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To compute \( 139 + 27 + 23 + 11 \), we can break it down step by step. Let's add the numbers starting from the smallest digit:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. Start with \( 139 \).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. Add \( 27 \):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    139 + 27 = 166
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. Add \( 23 \):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    166 + 23 = 189
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4. Add \( 11 \):
