[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m (1, 94), (2, 47), (4, 23), (7, 17), (11, 11)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m However, since each is less than 20 and the greatest common divisor is 1, the only valid pair is \((11, 11)\).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
