[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - \(\frac{3}{5} = 0.6\)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - \(\frac{7}{9} \approx 0.7778\)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So the inequality becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ 0.6 < \frac{x}{7} < 0.7778 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Step 2: Multiply all parts of the inequality by 7 to isolate \( x \).
