[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m First, express each term in a form that is easier to work with. Recall that \(3^i = \frac{3 \cdot 3^{i-1}}{3^{i-1}}\). So we have:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
