[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To understand this, let's start by examining the inner summand directly. Let's focus on the simplest case where \(a = 1\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \lfloor \log_1 (1 + 1 + 1) \rfloor + \lfloor \log_1 (1 + 1 + 1) \rfloor + \lfloor \log_1 (1 + 1 + 1) \rfloor = \lfloor \log_1 3 \rfloor + \lfloor \log_1 3 \rfloor + \lfloor \log_1 3 \rfloor.
