[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \lfloor \log_1 3 \rfloor = 1.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, the expression simplifies to:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1 + 1 + 1 = 3.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
