[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Convert $260$ to base $9$.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To convert the decimal number 260 to base 9, we need to repeatedly divide the number by 9 and keep track of the remainders. The remainders will form the digits of the base 9 number, starting from the least significant digit (rightmost) to the most significant digit (leftmost).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Let's perform the conversion step-by-step using Python code.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. Initialize an empty list to hold the remainders.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. Divide the number by 9 and append the remainder to the list.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. Repeat the division step until the number becomes 0.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4. The list of remainders will be the base 9 representation of the original number.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Let's do this calculation in Python:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m ```python
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m # Function to convert decimal to base 9
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m def decimal_to_base9(n):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m     if n == 0:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m         return "0"
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m     base9_digits = []
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m     while n > 0:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m         base9_digits.append(n % 9)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m         n = n // 9
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m     base9_digits.reverse()
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m     return ''.join(map(str, base9_digits))
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m # Convert 260 to base 9
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m decimal_number = 260
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m base9_representation = decimal_to_base9(decimal_number)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m print(base9_representation)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m ```
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m ```output
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1003
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m ```
