[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m A rectangle has an area of 400 $\text{cm}^2$. If the rectangle is a square, what is its perimeter?
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To find the perimeter of the square, we can follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. **Find the side length of the square:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    The area of a square is given by the formula:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \text{Area} = \text{side length}^2
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    We know the area is 400 \(\text{cm}^2\), so we can set up the equation:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \text{side length}^2 = 400
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    To find the side length, we take the square root of both sides:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \text{side length} = \sqrt{400} = 20
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    So, the side length of the square is 20 \(\text{cm}\).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. **Calculate the perimeter of the square:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    The perimeter of a square is given by the formula:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \text{Perimeter} = 4 \times \text{side length}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Substituting the side length we found:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \text{Perimeter} = 4 \times 20 = 80
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, the perimeter of the square is \(\boxed{80}\) \(\text{cm}\).<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m [Ground Truth]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 80
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m [Is Boxed Matched]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m True
