[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m      - Other possibilities include 135, 153.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 7. **List all the unique even three-digit numbers:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - From the above analysis, the unique even three-digit numbers are 155, 135, 153, 515, 151, and 513.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 8. **Count the unique number of x (\( z \)):**
