[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m we can use a mathematical property of arithmetic series. Specifically, we can pair the terms in such a way that many terms cancel out. Let's rewrite the expression by pairing the terms:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
