[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The slope \( m \) of a line passing through two points \((x_1, y_1)\) and \((x_2, y_2)\) is given by:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m m = \frac{y_2 - y_1}{x_2 - x_1}
