[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4. **Solve for \( b \):**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Simplify and solve for \( b \):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 8 = -28 + b
