[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 36 = b
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So, the y-intercept \( b \) is \( 36 \).
