[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Add $175_{9} + 714_{9} + 61_9$.  Express your answer in base $9$.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To add the numbers $175_{9} + 714_{9} + 61_{9}$, we need to convert them to base 10, perform the addition, and then convert the result back to base 9.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. Convert $175_{9}$ to base 10:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ 175_{9} = 1 \cdot 9^2 + 7 \cdot 9^1 + 5 \cdot 9^0 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ = 1 \cdot 81 + 7 \cdot 9 + 5 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ = 81 + 63 + 5 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ = 159_{10} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. Convert $714_{9}$ to base 10:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ 714_{9} = 7 \cdot 9^2 + 1 \cdot 9^1 + 4 \cdot 9^0 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ = 7 \cdot 81 + 1 \cdot 9 + 4 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ = 567 + 9 + 4 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ = 582_{10} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. Convert $61_{9}$ to base 10:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ 61_{9} = 6 \cdot 9^1 + 1 \cdot 9^0 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ = 6 \cdot 9 + 1 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ = 54 + 1 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ = 55_{10} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4. Add the base 10 equivalents:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ 159_{10} + 582_{10} + 55_{10} = 786_{10} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, we need to convert the result $786_{10}$ back to base 9. To do this, we repeatedly divide the number by 9 and keep track of the remainders.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ 786 \div 9 = 87 \text{ remainder } 0 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ 87 \div 9 = 9 \text{ remainder } 6 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ 9 \div 9 = 1 \text{ remainder } 0 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ 1 \div 9 = 0 \text{ remainder } 1 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Reading the remainders from bottom to top, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ 786_{10} = 1060_{9} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So, the answer in base 9 is \(\boxed{1060_{9}}\).<|endoftext|>
