[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - We can divide the rectangle into 1, 2, or 4 sections by placing 1 or 2 line segments through the rectangle.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - We can also divide the rectangle into 2 or 3 sections by placing a third segment through the rectangle.
