[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m In triangle $ABC$, $AX = XY = YB = BC$ and the measure of angle $ABC$ is 120 degrees. What is the number of degrees in the measure of angle $BAC$?
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m [asy]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m pair A,X,Y,B,C;
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m X = A + dir(30); Y = X + dir(0); B = Y + dir(60); C = B + dir(-30);
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m draw(B--Y--X--B--C--A--X);
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m label("$A$",A,W); label("$X$",X,NW); label("$Y$",Y,S); label("$B$",B,N); label("$C$",C,E);
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m [/asy]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
