[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. **Second Reduction:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Now, the price is reduced again by 50% of the reduced price. First, we find 50% of $7:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
