[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. **Solve for \( x \):**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    To isolate \( x \), first multiply both sides of the equation by 3:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    18 \times 3 = 12 + 21 + x
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Simplify the left side:
