[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    54 = 12 + 21 + x
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Now, combine the constants on the right side:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    54 = 33 + x
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4. **Isolate \( x \) by subtracting 33 from both sides:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
