[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To find the total surface area of the solid formed by cutting a right circular cylinder in half, we need to calculate the lateral surface area and the areas of the two circular bases, subtract these areas if necessary.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m ### Step 1: Calculate the lateral surface area
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The lateral surface area of a cylinder is given by:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ A_{\text{lateral}} = 2\pi r h \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m where \( r \) is the radius and \( h \) is the height of the cylinder.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Given \( r = 6 \) cm and \( h = 10 \) cm:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ A_{\text{lateral}} = 2\pi \times 6 \times 10 = 120\pi \text{ cm}^2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m ### Step 2: Calculate the area of each circular base
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The area of a circle is given by:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ A_{\text{base}} = \pi r^2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Given \( r = 6 \) cm:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ A_{\text{base}} = \pi \times 6^2 = 36\pi \text{ cm}^2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m ### Step 3: Calculate the total area of the two bases
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Since there are two bases, the area of the bases is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ A_{\text{bases}} = 2 \times 36\pi = 72\pi \text{ cm}^2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m ### Step 4: Subtract the total area of the bases from the lateral surface area
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The total surface area of the solid is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ A_{\text{total}} = A_{\text{lateral}} + A_{\text{bases}} = 120\pi + 72\pi = 192\pi \text{ cm}^2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Thus, the total surface area is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ \boxed{192\pi} \]<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m [Ground Truth]
