[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ a_2 = 0 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m However, we also know that \( a_1 \) must be some integer. Since there are no other coefficients listed, the integer root \( r \) must be a root of multiplicity 1, so \( r \) must be an integer and its positive integer values or \( r = 0 \).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
