[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To find out how many minutes Gage would have to skate the ninth day to average 85 minutes of skating each day for the entire time, we can break down the problem step by step.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. **Calculate the total distance Gage skated for the first 5 days:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Gage skated:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - 1 hr 15 min = \( 1 + \frac{15}{60} = \frac{31}{60} \) hours
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - 1 hr 30 min = \( 1 + \frac{30}{60} = \frac{9}{6} \) hours
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Total distance for the 5 days:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \text{Total distance} = 5 \times \left( \frac{31}{60} + \frac{9}{6} \right)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Convert the hours to minutes:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \frac{31}{60} + \frac{9}{6} = \frac{31}{60} + \frac{9}{12} = \frac{31}{60} + \frac{9}{12} = \frac{31}{60} + \frac{15}{20}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Convert to a common denominator:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \frac{15}{20} = \frac{15 \times 3}{20 \times 3} = \frac{45}{60}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Add the fractions:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \frac{31}{60} + \frac{45}{60} = \frac{76}{60}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Simplify:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \frac{76}{60} = \frac{38}{30} = \frac{19}{15} \approx 1.27 \text{ hours}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Convert back to minutes:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    19 \text{ hours} \times 60 \text{ minutes/hour} = 1140 \text{ minutes}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. **Calculate the total distance Gage skated for the first 3 days:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Total distance for the first 3 days:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \text{Total distance} = 3 \times \left( \frac{31}{60} + \frac{9}{6} \right)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    We already calculated this twice:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \text{Total distance} = 1140 \text{ minutes}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. **Calculate the total distance for the entire month:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Gage skated for a total of:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    15 \text{ days} \times 5 \text{ hours/day} + 3 \text{ days} \times 1 \text{ hour/day} = 75 \text{ hours} + 3 \text{ hours} = 78 \text{ hours}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Convert back to minutes:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    78 \text{ hours} \times 60 \text{ minutes/hour} = 4680 \text{ minutes}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4. **Calculate the average distance per day for the entire month:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Average distance per day:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \frac{4680 \text{ minutes}}{365 \text{ days}} \approx 12.32 \text{ minutes/day}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 5. **Determine the additional distance Gage needs to skater to average 85 minutes/day:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Gage needs to skater to average 85 minutes/day for 6 days:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    6 \text{ days} \times 85 \text{ minutes/day} = 510 \text{ minutes}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 6. **Calculate the additional distance Gage needs to skate on the ninth day:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Total additional distance needed:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    510 \text{ minutes}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
