[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To determine the area of a right triangle when two sides are given, we need to first understand the formula for the area of a right triangle. The area \(A\) of a right triangle with sides of lengths \(a\) and \(b\), and hypotenuse \(c\), can be calculated using:
