[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m ### Step 7: Determine the common ratio
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The ratio of consecutive terms yields:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ \frac{a_{2001}}{a_{2000}} = \frac{a_{2000} + d}{a_{2000}} = 1 + d = 1 + \frac{1492}{14} = \frac{1492 + 14}{14} = \frac{1506}{14} = \frac{753}{7} \]
