[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Expand \( f(x) \):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ f(x) = 4x^4 + 12x^3 \cdot 4x^4 + 12x^3 \cdot 12x^3 + 12x^3 \cdot (-9x^2) + 12x^3 \cdot x + 12x^3 \cdot 3 + \text{constant term} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ f(x) = 4x^4 + 48x^7 + 144x^6 - 108x^5 + 12x^4 + 36x^3 + \text{constant term} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, we need to find \( q(x) \). Since \( f(x) = q(x) \cdot d(x) + r(x) \), we can write:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ 4x^4 + 48x^7 + 144x^6 - 108x^5 + 12x^4 + 36x^3 + \text{constant term} = q(x)(x^2 + 3x - 2) + r(x) \]
