[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \end{aligned}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The terms do not match since \( 4x^4 + 3x^2(x^2 + 3x - 2) \) does not contribute to the polynomial.
