[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Thus, the total number of valid numbers is the 27 prime numbers. However, 27 is less than the total 33 possible permutations, hence adding this:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
