[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So,
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m x_1 x_2 \cdots x_8 = \frac{249993421}{16} = 1561003.075
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m However, this result seems incorrect given the exact terms and pattern identify. Let's recheck and verify the sequence terms:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m For \( n = 1, x_1 = 97 \)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m For \( n = 2, x_2 = \frac{2}{97} \)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m For \( n = 3, x_3 = \frac{3}{291} \)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m And so on...
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
