[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To find the nearest integer to \((5 + 2 \(\sqrt{7}\))^4\), we can use the binomial theorem. The binomial theorem states that for any natural number \(n\) and real numbers \(x\) and \(y\),
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
