[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To compute \(1002^2 - 502^2 + 298^2 - 202^2\), we can use the identities for squares of binomials. Specifically, we use the identity:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m x^2 - y^2 = (x - y)(x + y)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Let \(x = 1002\) and \(y = 502\). Then,
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1002^2 - 502^2 = (1002 - 502)(1002 + 502)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m First, calculate \(1002 - 502\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1002 - 502 = 500
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Next, calculate \(1002 + 502\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1002 + 502 = 1504
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, substitute these results back into the factored form:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1002^2 - 502^2 = 500 \times 1504
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Next, calculate the product \(500 \times 1504\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 500 \times 1504 = 500 \times (1500 + 4) = 500 \times 1500 + 500 \times 4
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Calculate \(500 \times 1500\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 500 \times 1500 = 750000
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Calculate \(500 \times 4\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 500 \times 4 = 2000
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Add these results together:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 750000 + 2000 = 752000
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Thus, the final answer is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
