[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \text{Area} = \frac{1}{2} \left| 0(2 - 0) + (-5)(0 - 1) + 0(1 - 2) \right|
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Simplify the expression inside the absolute value:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \text{Area} = \frac{1}{2} \left| 0 + (-5)(-1) + 0 \right| = \frac{1}{2} \left| 0 + 5 + 0 \right| = \frac{1}{2} \left| 5 \right| = \frac{1}{2} \times 5 = \frac{5}{2}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, the area of the triangle is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
