[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Both terms in the expression \(x(x+2) + (x+2)\) have a common factor of \((x+2)\).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. **Factor out the common factor:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    We can factor out \((x+2)\) from each term:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
