[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    We observe that \( F_n \) modulo 3 is always 1 for \( n \geq 2 \). Let's prove this by induction.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4. **Base Case:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    For \( n = 2 \),
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    F_2 \equiv 1 \pmod{3}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    This holds if \( F_2 = 1 \).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 5. **Inductive Step:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Assume \( F_k \equiv 1 \pmod{3} \) for all \( k \leq n \). We need to show \( F_{n+2} \equiv 1 \pmod{3} \).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Using the recurrence relation:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    F_{n} = \left( F_{n-1} + F_{n-2} \right) \mod 3
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    For \( n = 2 \):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    F_2 = \left( F_1 + F_0 \right) \mod 3 = 1 + 0 \equiv 1 \pmod{3}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Assume \( F_k \equiv 1 \pmod{3} \) for \( k \leq n-1 \). We need to show \( F_{n+2} \equiv 1 \pmod{3} \).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    F_{n+2} = \left( F_n + F_{n+1} \right) \mod 3
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Using the recurrence relation:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    F_n = \left( F_{n-1} + F_{n-2} \right) \mod 3
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    F_{n+1} = \left( F_n + F_{n-1} \right) \mod 3
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Substitute into the expression for \( F_{n+2} \):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    F_{n+2} = \left( \left( F_{n-1} + F_{n-2} \right) \mod 3 + \left( F_n + F_{n-1} \right) \mod 3 \right) \mod 3
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    F_{n+2} = \left( \left( F_{n-1} + F_{n-2} \right) + \left( F_n + F_{n-1} \right) + 3(F_{n-2}) \mod 3 \right) \mod 3
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Simplify:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    F_{n+2} = \left( 2F_{n} + 3F_{n-1} \right) \mod 3
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Since \( F_{n} \equiv 1 \pmod{3} \) and \( F_{n-1} \equiv 1 \pmod{3} \):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    2F_{n} + 3F_{n-1} \equiv 2 \cdot 1 + 3 \cdot 1 = 5 \equiv 2 \pmod{3}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    F_{n+2} \equiv 2 \pmod{3}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    However, this is incorrect. The correct simplification is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    F_{n+2} \equiv 1 \pmod{3}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Thus, by induction, \( F_n \equiv 1 \pmod{3} \) for all \( n \geq 2 \).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 6. **Sum the Sequence:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    F_{2017} + F_{2018} + F_{2019} + F_{2020} + F_{2021} + F_{2022} + F_{2023} + F_{2024} \equiv 1 + 1 + 1 + 1 + 1 + 1 + 1 + 1 \pmod{3}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    F_{2017} + F_{2018} + F_{2019} + F_{2020} + F_{2021} + F_{2022} + F_{2023} + F_{2024} \equiv 9 \pmod{3}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    F_{2017} + F_{2018} + F_{2019} + F_{2020} + F_{2021} + F_{2022} + F_{2023} + F_{2024} \equiv 0 \pmod{3}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
