[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Given standard mathematical definitions in unit circles, the value of \(\cos 45^\circ\) is often treated as a simple numeric value but defined with any special reference one would need. For the vast majority factual figure, though, we would only recognize a specialized context like if we were looking at specific geometric references or contexts.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
