[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - **Tomahawk Submarines**: Modular submarines used for industrial workspaces and treaty activity.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - **Byron**: Navy/airborne vehicle developed in World War II for aerial reconnaissance and torpedo attack.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - **LAMAS III**: Space station stage development in the 1970s.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. **Space Exploration Resources**: Websites like NASA.gov, Encyclopædia Britannica, and Astronomy Magazine have articles and images related to the historic development of rockets in human space exploration.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
