[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The bottoms of two vertical poles are 12 feet apart and are on a region of flat ground. One pole is 6 feet tall and the other is 15 feet tall. How long, in feet, is a wire stretched from the top of one pole to the top of the other pole?
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To find the length of the wire stretched from the tops of the two poles, we need to determine the hypotenuse of a right triangle formed by the heights of the poles. The lengths of the two sides of this right triangle are the differences in the heights of the poles (15 feet - 6 feet = 9 feet) and the tops of the poles (12 feet - 6 feet = 6 feet).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, we can use the Pythagorean theorem to find the length of the hypotenuse (which is the length of the wire):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ c = \sqrt{a^2 + b^2} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m where \( a \) and \( b \) are the lengths of the legs of the right triangle, i.e., \( a = 9 \) feet and \( b = 6 \) feet.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Substituting the values into the formula, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ c = \sqrt{9^2 + 6^2} = \sqrt{81 + 36} = \sqrt{117} = \sqrt{9 \cdot 13} = 3\sqrt{13} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The hypotenuse of the right triangle is \( \sqrt{117} \) feet. To convert this to the simplest form, we can use decimal approximation:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ \sqrt{117} \approx 10.827 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Converting this to exactly 3 square roots of 13, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ \sqrt{117} = 3 \cdot \sqrt{13} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, the exact length of the wire is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ \boxed{3 \sqrt{13}} \]<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m [Ground Truth]
