[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m What is the least positive integer that has a remainder of 0 when divided by 2, a remainder of 1 when divided by 3, and a remainder of 2 when divided by 4?
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
