[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To solve the expression \(9 \Psi (3 \Psi 1)\) given the relation \(A \Psi B = 2A + 5B\), we need to follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. **Evaluate \(3 \Psi 1\):**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    According to the definition of the relation \(\Psi\),
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
