[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To find the area of the rectangle, we need to determine the lengths of the sides AB and BC, and then use the formula for the area of a rectangle, which is \( \text{Area} = \text{base} \times \text{height} \).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m From the diagram, we know the following:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - The perimeter of the rectangle is 56.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - The length of the side AB (crossed by the line \(x+2\)) is \(x+2\).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - The length of the side BC (crossed by the line \(x-2\)) is \(x-2\).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m First, we use the perimeter to find the sum of the lengths of the crossbars AB and BC:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m (x+2) + (x-2) = 56
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Simplifying the left side, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2x = 56
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Solving for \(x\), we divide both sides by 2:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m x = 28
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now that we know \(x = 28\), we can find the lengths of the sides AB and BC:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - The length of the side AB is \(x+2 = 28+2 = 30\).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - The length of the side BC is \(x-2 = 28-2 = 26\).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The area of the rectangle is the product of the length of the side AB and the length of the side BC:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \text{Area} = AB \times BC = 30 \times 26 = 780
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, the area of the rectangle is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \boxed{780}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
