[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[ -8x^2 + 2x^3 + 6x^3 = -8x^2 + 8x^3 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. Combine all other terms:
