[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3x^{10} - 3x^7 + 2x^2(m - 4x) - 3x + 3x^2 + 21 - 20 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Combine these back into one polynomial:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3x^{10} - 3x^7 + 6x^2(m - 4x) - 3x + 3x^2 + 21 - 20 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Factor out \(3\) from the first few terms:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ 
