[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Since \( 10 \leq T \leq A \) and \( 10 \leq E \leq A \), we need to check which values satisfy \( M, N, E \)'s subtraction (which must be non-negative integer values). Let's try \( A = 7 \):
