[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To solve this problem, we need to identify the three-digit integers with a 5 in the units place and determine how many of those numbers are divisible by 15. 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m A number is divisible by 15 if and only if it is divisible by both 3 and 5. Since a number is divisible by 3 if the sum of its digits is divisible by 3, we need to consider three-digit numbers with a 5 in the units place which end in 5 and are divisible by 5. This means the number can end in either 0 or 5.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
