[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, to solve for $x$, we take the reciprocal of $\dfrac{1}{3}$, which gives us:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m x = 3
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So, the solution to the equation is:
