[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To find the least integer value of \( x \) that satisfies the inequality \( 2|x| + 7 < 17 \), we will solve the inequality step by step. Let's start by isolating \( |x| \).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
