[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. \( -x + 3 = -7 \)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m ### Case 1: \( -x + 3 = 7 \)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m First, solve for \( x \):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - x + 3 = 7
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Subtract 3 from both sides:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - x = 4
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Multiply both sides by -1:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m x = -4
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m ### Case 2: \( -x + 3 = -7 \)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m First, solve for \( x \):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - x + 3 = -7
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Subtract 3 from both sides:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - x = -10
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Multiply both sides by -1:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m x = 10
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So, the solutions to the equation \( |-x + 3| = 7 \) are \( x = -4 \) and \( x = 10 \).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Among these, the least value is \( x = -4 \).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, the least value of \( x \) that is a solution to the equation is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \boxed{-4}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
