[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m ### Step 2: Sum the Remainders
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The sum of \(a\), \(b\), and \(c\) is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
