[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m ### Step 3: Apply the Chinese Remainder Theorem
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m We need to find \(x\) such that:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m x \equiv 26 \pmod{12}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m This means we need to find an integer \(x\) such that:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
