[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m x = 12k + 26
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m We need \(x \equiv 26 \pmod{12}\). This implies:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
