[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. The highest power of \(x\) in the polynomial inside the parentheses is 2. This is because \(x^2\) raised to the power 2 will give a term with degree 2.
