[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m A box contains 5 white balls and 6 black balls.  Five balls are drawn out of the box at random.  What is the probability that they all are white?
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To determine the probability that all five balls drawn from the box are of the same color (either all white or all black), we need to follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. **Calculate the total number of ways to choose 5 balls out of 11:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    This can be done using the binomial coefficient:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \binom{11}{5} = \frac{11!}{5!(11-5)!} = \frac{11!}{5! \cdot 6!}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Simplifying this, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \binom{11}{5} = \frac{11 \times 10 \times 9 \times 8 \times 7}{5 \times 4 \times 3 \times 2 \times 1} = 462
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. **Calculate the number of ways to draw all white balls:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    There are 5 white balls, and we need to choose all 5 of them. The number of ways to choose 5 white balls out of 5 is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \binom{5}{5} = \frac{5!}{5!(5-5)!} = \frac{5!}{5! \cdot 0!} = 1
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. **Calculate the number of ways to draw all black balls:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    There are 6 black balls, and we need to choose all 5 of them. The number of ways to choose 5 black balls out of 6 is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \binom{6}{5} = \frac{6!}{5!(6-5)!} = \frac{6!}{5! \cdot 1!} = 6
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4. **Calculate the probability of drawing all white balls:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    The probability is the number of favorable outcomes divided by the total number of outcomes:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    P(\text{all white balls}) = \frac{\text{Number of ways to draw all white balls}}{\text{Total number of ways to draw all 5 balls}} = \frac{1}{462}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 5. **Calculate the probability of drawing all black balls:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    P(\text{all black balls}) = \frac{\text{Number of ways to draw all black balls}}{\text{Total number of ways to draw all 5 balls}} = \frac{6}{462}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 6. **Combine the probabilities:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    Since these are the only two favorable outcomes, we add their probabilities:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    P(\text{all white balls}) + P(\text{all black balls}) = \frac{1}{462} + \frac{6}{462} = \frac{7}{462}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, the probability that all five balls drawn are of the same color is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \boxed{\frac{7}{462}}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m [Ground Truth]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \dfrac{1}{462}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m [Is Boxed Matched]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m True
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m [Extracted Answer]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \frac{7}{462}
