[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m A pencil costs $p$ dollars and an eraser costs $e$ dollars. Mark buys $3$ more pencils than erasers, and he buys $7$ pencils. Write an expression that represents the amount of money that Mark spent, in dollars.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Hi Mark, I'm a helpful assistant. Let's break down the problem step by step.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m First, we need to find out the number of pencils and erasers Mark bought.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - Mark buys 7 pencils.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - He buys 3 more pencils than erasers. If we let \( e \) be the number of erasers, then the number of pencils Mark buys is \( 7 + 3 = 10 \).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - Therefore, the number of erasers Mark buys is \( e \).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The cost of the pencils is \( 30\% \) of the total cost because Mark buys 10 pencils, and each pencil costs \( p \) dollars. So the total cost of the pencils is \( 0.3 \times (10 \times p) = 30p \) dollars.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The cost of the erasers is \( 70\% \) of the total cost because he buys 3 more pencils than erasers, so the total cost is \( 0.7 \times (7 + e) \times (e - 3) = 0.7 \times (10p - e(e - 3)) = 0.7 \times (10p - ep + 3e) = 7p + 0.7p - 0.7ep = 7p + 3e - 0.7ep \) dollars.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m In math, we represent this expression using formula notation, which is \( 7p + 3e - 0.7ep = (7 - 0.7e)p + 3e \).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So, the expression that represents the amount of money that Mark spent is \(\boxed{(7 - 0.7e)p + 3e}\).<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m [Ground Truth]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 7p+4e
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m [Is Boxed Matched]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m True
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m [Extracted Answer]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m (7-0.7e)p+3e
