[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To find the maximum value of the function \( f(n) \) defined by the given rules, we will analyze the function step by step.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. **Understanding the Function:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    f(n) = \begin{cases} 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    n + 10 & \text{if } n < 10, \\
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    f(n - 5) & \text{if } n \ge 10.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \end{cases}
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    This means that for \( n < 10 \), \( f(n) \) is simply \( n + 10 \).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. **Case Analysis:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - **Case 1: \( n < 10 \):**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m      For \( n \leq 10 \), \( f(n) = n + 10 \).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - **Case 2: \( n \geq 10 \):**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m      For \( n \geq 10 \), \( f(n) = f(n - 5) \).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m      Substituting \( n = 10 \) into the recursive definition, we get \( f(10) = f(5) \).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. **Further Analysis for \( f(10) \):**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - If \( n \geq 10 \), then \( f(n) = f(n - 5) \).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - For \( n = 10 \):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m      10 - 5 = 5
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m      The function now is \( f(n) = f(5) \).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4. **Recursive Definition and Iteration:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - For \( n = 10 \), we have \( f(10) = f(5) \).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - For \( n = 11 \):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m      11 - 5 = 6
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m      The function now is \( f(n) = f(6) \).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - For \( n = 12 \):
