[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 5. **Calculate the probability of Javier not having any of the ingredients:**
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - The probability that Javier does not have rye bread is \(\frac{2}{6} = \frac{1}{3}\).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    - The probability that Javier does not have tuna is \(\frac{0}{6} = 0\).
