[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Ellipse,Center:(\frac{1}{2},\frac{1}{3}),Radius:\frac{\sqrt{11}}{6},Circumference:\frac{\pi\sqrt{11}}{3},AreaEnclosed:\frac{11\pi}{36}
