[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To find the remainder when the base 4 number \(120301232_4\) is divided by 8, we can simplify the process by using properties of modular arithmetic. Specifically, we will convert the base 4 number to a base 10 number and then find the remainder when this value is divided by 8.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
