[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1 \cdot 4^{10} + 2 \cdot 4^9 + 0 \cdot 4^8 + 3 \cdot 4^7 + 0 \cdot 4^6 + 1 \cdot 4^5 + 2 \cdot 4^4 + 3 \cdot 4^3 + 2 \cdot 4^2
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, let's compute each term separately:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
