[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So, the base 10 equivalent of \(120301232_4\) is 1620786.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Next, we need to find the remainder when 1620786 is divided by 8. We do this by summing the digits of 1620786 and finding the remainder when this sum is divided by 8.
