[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. Recognize that the relationship isn't consistent, so we should re-evaluate our setup. Instead, let's focus on simplifying directly:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m     \[
