[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m     \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m     Let \(\angle D = x\). Then:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m     \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m     \angle B = \frac{x}{3}
