[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, we need to find the remainder when the product \(99 \times 101\) is divided by 9. Since we already know that \(99 \equiv 0 \pmod{9}\), we can substitute this value directly into the expression:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
