[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To find \(AB + A\), we first need to identify the values of \(A\) and \(B\) from the expression \(Ay^2 - 65y + 42 = (Ay-14)(By-3) = ABy - ABy - 14Ay + 42B\).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
