[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ 400 + 1600 + 4284 + 3(82)(18) = 400 + 1600 + 4284 + 4224 = 10308 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Finally, we double this value:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[ 20^2 \cdot 1600 + 3(82)(18) = 20^2 \cdot 1600 + 3(82)(18) = 400 \cdot 1600 + 3(82)(18) = 640000 + 4364 = 644364 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
