[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - \(11 \times 1887 = 20757\) (invalid since 11 is not the product)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - \(12 \times 1887 = 22324\) (invalid since 12 is not the product)
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m - \(13 \times 1887 = 24331\) (invalid since 13 is not the product)
