[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m This is a contradiction unless \( b = 0 \). Therefore, we need to re-evaluate the problem. The only consistent solution is when the imaginary part is zero, which occurs when \( b = 0 \). Therefore, we need to check the correct interpretation and find the correct value of \( b \).
