[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To find the 205th digit after the decimal point in the decimal representation of \(\frac{1}{206}\), we first need to determine the repeating decimal pattern. We start by performing the division:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
