[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    The minimum value of the function \( f(x) = \frac{x^2 + 7}{\sqrt{x^2 + 3}} \) occurs at \( x = 0 \) and is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m    \[
