[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Combine these:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m A(x^2 - x - 2) + B(x^2 - 4x + 4) + C(x^2 - 3x + 2) + D = 4x^3 - 20x^2 + 37x - 25.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, we equate the numerators:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m A(x^2 - x - 2) + B(x^2 - 4x + 4) + C(x^2 - 3x + 2) + D = 4x^3 - 20x^2 + 37x - 25.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Next, we clear the denominators by multiplying both sides by \((x-1)(x-2)^3\):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m A(x^2 - x - 2)(x-1)(x-2)^3 + B(x^2 - 4x + 4)(x-1)(x-2)^3 + C(x^2 - 3x + 2)(x-1)(x-2)^3 + D(x-1)(x-2)^3 = 4x^3 - 20x^2 + 37x - 25.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Expand each term:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m A(x^2 - x - 2)(x-2)x^3 = A(x^2 - x - 2)(x^4 - 2x^2 x - 2x^3 + 2x^4),
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m where \(x = x - 2\).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, rewrite the left-hand side:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m A(x^2 - x - 2)(x^4 - 2x^2 x - 2x^3 + 2x^4) = A(x^6 - 2x^4 - 3x^5 + 4x^3 - 2x^4) = A(x^6 - 5x^4 - 3x^5 + 4x^3).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The right-hand side includes terms that need to match:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 4x^3 - 20x^2 + 37x - 25 = 4(x^3 - 5x^2 + \frac{37}{x^2} - \frac{25}{x}).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now, compare coefficients:
