[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m To solve this problem, we need to determine the number of students who selected milk. We know that 60% of the students selected soda, and 20% selected milk. We also know that 72 students selected soda. Let's denote the total number of students by \( x \).
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
