[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. Identify the letter that starts with the same letter as his birthday: This means the surname of the villain starts with March.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. Determine the pattern: In general, vowels recur every four months, and consonants only once every two months. Since March is the first month where we can determine a pattern, let's analyze the first four months to identify the pattern.
