[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Let's break down the steps:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. Identify all possible two-digit numbers.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. Check which of these numbers have their digits whose product is 8.
