[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m The maximum value of \(2x^3\) is \(24\), which occurs at \(x = 3\). Therefore, the maximum value of \(a^3 + b^3 + c^3 + d^3\) is \(24\).
