[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Sure, I can help you with that. The product of $121_{5}$ and $11_{5}$ in base five is:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$121_{5} \times 11_{5} = ?$$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m First, we need to convert both numbers from base five to base ten:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. Convert $121_{5}$ to base ten:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$121_{5} = 1 \times 5^{2} + 2 \times 5^{1} + 1 \times 5^{0} = 1 \times 25 + 2 \times 5 + 1 \times 1 = 25 + 10 + 1 = 36$$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. Convert $11_{5}$ to base ten:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$11_{5} = 1 \times 5^{1} + 1 \times 5^{0} = 1 \times 5 + 1 \times 1 = 5 + 1 = 6$$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Now we need to multiply the base ten values:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$36_{10} \times 6_{10} = 216_{10}$$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Finally, we need to convert the base ten number $216_{10}$ back to base five. To do this, we need to determine the coefficients for the powers of 5:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 1. Divide 216 by $5^{2}$ (0th power):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$216 \div 25 = 8 \text{ remainder } 1$$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So, the coefficient of $5^2$ is 8.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 2. Take the remainder and divide by $5^{1}$ (1st power):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$1 \div 5 = 0 \text{ remainder } 1$$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So, the coefficient of $5^1$ is 1.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 3. Take the remainder and divide by $5^{0}$ (0th power):
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$1 \div 1 = 1 \text{ remainder } 1$$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So, the coefficient of $5^0$ is 1.
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Putting these coefficients together, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m $$216_{10} = 8(5^2) + 1(5^1) + 1(5^0) = 8 \times 25 + 1 \times 5 + 1 \times 1 = 216$$
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m Therefore, the product of $121_{5}$ and $11_{5}$ is $216_{5}$.
