[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m So,
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2326006)[0m \|(-3737) \mod 8\| = \frac{|-3737|}{8} \cdot \gcd(3737, 8) = \frac{3737}{8} \cdot \gcd(3737, 8)\]
